window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4201,"title":"Chapter 4201: What Happened Back Then (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu threw his hand off and brushed it away with her sleeve, looking as if he had smudged it. Feng Yanbing was furious...","Feng Wu stared at Feng Yanbing. “Do you have something to say? If not, I have something to tell you.”","Feng Yanbing didn’t see that coming.","He had always been a cold-blooded man, but other people had always been nice to him. Feng Yanbing was under the impression that no matter how he treated other people, as long as he wanted to, he would be able to make them happy.","At that thought, Feng Yanbing fought back his anger and smiled at Feng Wu. “Fine, tell me. What do you want to say?”","Feng Wu sat down in a chair and said unhurriedly, “What am I going to say? Of course, I’m going to get even.”","Feng Yanbing asked, “Get even?”","Feng Wu asked, “Did you know Princess Royal before you married my mother?”","Feng Yanbing frowned.","Feng Wu stared at him. “Speak.”","Feng Yanbing looked around at the others and made it very clear.","Feng Wu said indifferently, “They’re all my brothers and know what happened in the past. There’s nothing to hide. Or, do you think what you did back then","“Ahem!” Feng Yanbing coughed in frustration. “What if I don’t answer?”","Feng Wu smirked. “Are you really here today just to see me? You haven’t visited me for over a decade, but you’ve suddenly become a good father? You need my help, don’t you?”","She was right. Feng Yanbing had indeed come here today to ask for Feng Wu’s help, and it was a very difficult thing to ask...","The Princess Royal had given the order that they had to save Ning Er, or he would... Feng Yanbing sighed inwardly at that thought, but he still put on a fatherly face and looked at Feng Wu with a gentle look in his eyes. “I’ll tell you anything you want to know. We’re father and daughter, and we can’t part with each other. No one can drive a wedge between us.”","He glanced at the teenagers of the Luo family as he spoke.","Luo Zilin crossed his arms and snorted. So, he was her father now.","Feng Wu gave Feng Yanbing a half-smile and said indifferently, “Let’s get back to what we were talking about. Did you know the Princess Royal before you married my mother?”","Feng Yanbing said, “I’ve met her before, but we weren’t that close.”","Feng Wu said, “Did you leave us behind in the Junwu Empire because of Princess Royal?”","Feng Yanbing was baffled. He didn’t expect Feng Wu to ask about the past.","“It’s all in the past. What’s there to talk about?” Feng Yanbing feigned a displeased tone.","Feng Wu only sat there and said indifferently, “That’s the most important thing. If you don’t make it clear today, you’ll never see me again.”","Feng Yanbing gritted his teeth. Fine, he would put up with her for a while. After this was over...","“Princess Royal came to Junwu herself and told me that she could help me.” Feng Yanbing pushed the blame away, making himself look very innocent. Feng Wu stared at him. “So, Princess Royal wanted to take you back to Dayan, and you agreed.”","Feng Yanbing said, “No one would dare to defy the Princess Royal, right?”","Feng Wu said, “So, was Princess Royal the culprit of my mother’s condition?”","Feng Yanbing said, “Well... about that...","Feng Wu said, “Tell me the truth!”","Feng Yanbing said, “It was complicated, but your mother’s injury was indeed related to the Princess Royal..”"]},{"number":4202,"title":"Chapter 4202: What Happened Back Then (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Yanbing said, “It was complicated, but your mother’s injury was indeed related to the Princess Royal.”","Feng Wu glanced at Feng Yanbing.","Feng Yanbing didn’t want to say another word. Feng Wu asked, “Did Princess Royal do it?”","Feng Yanbing said, “Well, it wasn’t like that...’","Feng Wu asked, “Did the Princess Royal let someone else do it?”","Feng Yanbing said, “It’s all in the past now, so stop worrying about it. Xiao Wu, we have to move on...”","But Feng Wu cut him off.","“So, did the Princess Royal tell vou to do it?” Feng Wu stared at Feng Yanbing.","WHAT?!","Before Feng Yanbing could say anything, the Luo brothers’ eyes popped.","What was that?","Back then?","That wasn’t possible!","After all, their aunt was so nice to Feng Yanbing!","Feng Wu’s heart sank when she saw Feng Yanbing’s reaction.","“It really was you.” Feng Wu was only probing.","With the Princess Royal’s willfulness, she knew how to hurt a woman. She had to make the man that Luo Xuanji loved to do it himself...","“Are you even human?!” Luo Zilin grabbed Feng Yanbing by the collar.","“Let go of me!” Feng Yanbing pushed Luo Zilin away. However, Feng Wu struck out the next moment.","Smack!","She slapped him hard.","Feng Yanbing touched his left cheek and stared at Feng Wu in disbelief. “How dare you hit me? I’m your father!” Feng Wu smirked. “Did I say you were?”","Feng Yanbing said, “You!”","Feng Wu said, “You deserved that!”","Feng Yanbing said, “Feng Wu, I’ve put up with you for a very long time. Since you won’t listen, I won’t hold back anymore!”","He then reached out to grab Feng Wu.","However, Feng Wu slapped him again as soon as he touched her.","Feng Yanbing stared at Feng Wu in disbelief!","He was a Level-6 Spiritual Sovereign, but Feng Wu was a Level-3 one. How was that possible?","Feng Yanbing glared at Feng Wu. “You’re...”","Feng Wu said indifferently, “I’m more than enough to defeat you. I didn’t want to, but you’re so abominable that I can’t stand it anymore.","“I, Feng Wu, challenge you now!”","Feng Yanbing said, ‘You’re only at Level 3. Do you have a death wish?”","Feng Wu said, “We’ll only know after we fight!”","Feng Wu struck out before Feng Yanbing could say another word.","Feng Wu took the chance when Feng Yanbing wasn’t looking and kicked Feng Yanbing all the way out of the main hall. Countless people saw the entire process.","Everyone’s eyes popped. “Is that Miss Wu?”","“Is he our former son-in-law?”","“If that’s the case, she’s offending her superior!”","“Shouldn’t you be concerned about how capable Miss Wu is now? Feng Yanbing is a Level-6 Spiritual Sovereign! He’s also a famous person in our empire!” “Could it be that Prince Consort Feng has given in to Miss Feng Wu?”","“Give in? Can’t you see the blue veins on his neck? He’s so mad! He would have fought back if he could!”","The others then realized that Feng Yanbing was furious...","Just then, Feng Wu kicked Feng Yanbing out of the house with one last kick and snorted.. “Don’t think you can get away with it just like that!”"]},{"number":4203,"title":"Chapter 4203: Can’t Help It","paragraphs":["Chapter 4203: Can’t Help It","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Yanbing couldn’t believe it!","How was that even possible?!","Wasn’t the girl supposed to be a Level-3 Spiritual Sovereign? How could she defeat him and kick him away?","Feng Yanbing didn’t have time to react and just lay there in a trance-like state.","“Master...”","Feng Yanbing was followed by a guard named Huo Bin.","Huo Bin helped Feng Yanbing to his feet and didn’t know what to say.","He had been trying to speak up for Feng Yanbing when he was in the main hall, but the girl was so fierce that he couldn’t believe what he heard. He was so shocked that he didn’t know how to react. When he finally realized what had happened, Feng Yanfeng was already lying on the ground. Feng Yanbing coughed with a hand on his chest.","He couldn’t stand the humiliation.","“Master...’","Huo Bin felt uneasy when he saw the look on Feng Yanbing’s face.","“Let’s go back!” Clenching his fists, Feng Yanbing stormed off.","The Luo family.","Luo Zilin put an arm around Feng Wu’s shoulder. “Kiddo, you’re amazing! How can you beat up a Level-6 Spiritual Sovereign now? That’s incredible!”","Luo Zilin wasn’t convinced at first when he saw how fast Feng Wu was making her breakthrough, but after seeing the way she fought and how mercilessly she had kicked her father away, he was full of admiration.","Luo Ziji was concerned. “We all know that he has done a lot of bad things, but after all, he’s your father, and you can’t change the fact that you’re related to him by blood. If word gets out that you’ve lost your temper today, I’m afraid it’ll damage your reputation.”","Feng Wu gave it some thought and nodded. “Did you hear what he said? No one could have stood it. I was so mad that I lost my mind. I’ll be more careful next time.”","Luo Ziji asked, “What are you going to do next time?”","Feng Wu hesitated. “Shall I put a sack over his head first?”","Luo Ziji cleared his throat. It seemed that his father had done similar things recently.","In the Princess Royal’s residence.","Seeing that Feng Yanbing had come back with bruises all over his face, the Princess Royal frowned. “What’s going on? Didn’t you say you were going to bring Feng Wu back? Why isn’t she here?”","Feng Yanbing went back inside without saying a word.","The Princess Royal followed him in. “I knew she probably wouldn’t come, but what happened to your face? Did the Luo family hurt you?”","The more she said, the angrier the Princess Royal became. “How dare the Luo family hurt my people! And you, you’ve been too soft on the Luo family! If they dare to hurt you, just come back and tell me. I’ll get my brother to punish them!”","Feng Yanbing’s heart sank when he recalled the hatred in Feng Wu’s eyes when she stared at him...","“I’m going to court now! I just want their blood and hearts! Not only didn’t they give it to me, but they also hit you!”","Princess Royal ran into the palace angrily.","Feng Yanbing lay in bed without saying a word, and his eyes gradually went blank.","Was it really his fault?","Did that girl hate him that much?","But he really didn’t do anything. The Princess Royal had forced him to do all those things. He didn’t have a choice.","Why couldn’t Feng Wu understand how difficult it was for him? Feng Yanbing rubbed his head in frustration.."]},{"number":4204,"title":"Chapter 4204: Revenge (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4204: Revenge (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Why couldn’t Feng Wu understand how difficult it was for him? Feng Yanbing rubbed his head in frustration.","The Princess Royal really went to court.","The Princess Royal had always been Emperor Yan’s right-hand woman. Therefore, when she went to the imperial palace to complain, Emperor Yan didn’t like Feng Wu at all. As a result, he disliked the Luo family even more.","“The Luo family is getting bolder and bolder, and they’re disrespecting the royal family even more.” The Princess Royal tried to incite Emperor Yan.","Crossing his hands behind his back, Emperor Yan snorted. “Your husband was beaten up by the Luo family. I see that he’s not that capable.”","Feng Yanbing had been kicked out of the Luo family by Feng Wu, and of course, he had forbidden anyone from talking about it. Therefore, the Princess Royal only knew that he had been kicked out by the Luo family, but she didn’t know that it was Feng Wu.","Even if she did, she wouldn’t believe it.","“And Feng Wu isn’t any good either.” Emperor Yan glanced at the Princess Royal. “What are you going to do?”","The Princess Royal said, “Ning Er’s medicine needs that Feng Xiaoqi, but I heard that Feng Wu had the Divine Phoenix Blood...’","“The Divine Phoenix Blood? You mean... his Divine Phoenix Blood?” Emperor Yan was obviously surprised.","The Princess Royal was secretly pleased, but she didn’t let it show. She nodded and said, “Yes, it’s the Divine Phoenix Blood that Mu Jiuzhou used to have.”","Mu Jiuzhou was in fact a nickname. His real surname was Shangguan, which was the same as Emperor Yan.","However, they would rather call him Mu Jiuzhou than his other name.","“Isn’t he dead? Why is the Divine Phoenix Blood...” Emperor Yan narrowed his eyes. “I saw it with my own eyes...”","The Princess Royal shook her head. “I wonder if Feng Wu’s Divine Phoenix Blood has anything to do with Mu Jiuzhou. It shouldn’t...”","The look on Emperor Yan’s face turned grimmer.","The Princess Royal said, “Moreover, the Sacred Mu Cliff didn’t show up to pick her up from Dynasty Road, which means that she may not have anything to do with Mu Jiuzhou.”","Emperor Yan waved his hand. “Not necessarily...’","While Emperor Yan was mumbling to himself, the Princess Royal smiled a little.","She knew that Mu Jiuzhou was the person Emperor Yan feared the most. Anyone associated with Mu Jiuzhou would become his archenemy. Mu Jiuzhou was no longer around, and despite the low profile of the Sacred Mu Cliff, it was still a thorn in Emperor Yan’s side. That was how intimidating Mu Jiuzhou used to be.","Therefore, the princess knew when she associated Feng Wu with Mu Jiuzhou,","Emperor Yan would want to kill Feng Wu.","She was right.","Emperor Yan glanced at the Princess Royal and frowned. “Find out if Feng Wu really is related to Mu Jiuzhou. If that’s the case, kill her.”","The Princess Royal hesitated. “But Feng Wu is very talented. I don’t think my people can do anything to her...”","Emperor Yan looked apprehensive. “Has she become so capable already?”","The Princess Royal nodded. “She’s a Level-3 Spiritual Sovereign at least.”","Emperor Yan said, “At her age, she’s indeed a genius. Even if she has nothing to do with Mu Jiuzhou, she still has half of the Luo family’s bloodline. The Luo family...”","After some hesitation, he told the Princess Royal, “Just do it.”","The Princess Royal seemed surprised. “But Mu Jiuzhou...”","Emperor Yan waved his hand. “I don’t care if she has anything to do with Mu Jiuzhou. She has the bloodline of the Luo family, and that’s enough. Let’s get rid of her before she grows up..”"]},{"number":4205,"title":"Chapter 4205: Get Rid of Her","paragraphs":["Chapter 4205: Get Rid of Her","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Emperor Yan waved his hand. “I don’t care if she has anything to do with Mu Jiuzhou. She has the bloodline of the Luo family, and that’s enough. Let’s get rid of her before she grows up.”","The Princess Royal left in satisfaction.","Feng Wu had no idea that Emperor Yan had given the order to kill her. Right now, she was still sparring with her brothers in the Luo manor to improve her cultivation.","Three months passed in a matter of seconds.","The legendary Dragon Gate Banquet was about to start.","Luo Zilin patted Feng Wu on the shoulder. “Kiddo, I’m going to register you.”","Feng Wu looked up. “The Dragon Gate Banquet?”","Luo Zilin nodded. “That’s right. It’s the Dragon Gate Banquet. With your current cultivation level, you can do whatever you want there, but...” Feng Wu asked, “But what?”","Luo Zilin said, “It’s just that the Dayan Empire is filled with talented youngsters. No one of your age has risen to Level 6, but the age limit of the Dragon Gate Banquet is very lenient. Anyone under 25 can attend.","“A few have reached Level 6 before the age of 25, so your opponents are still very capable. You can’t take them lightly.","Feng Wu asked, “Who are the Level 6 Spiritual Sovereigns?”","Luo Zilin said, “Of the four major clans, Brother Zibo is the only one that meets the criteria. The eldest son of the royal family and the son of Lord Yan aren’t as good yet.","“Of the six forces, Murong Linan of the Murong clan, Ye Yijian of the Formless","Sword Sect, and Qiu Zhennan of the Mountain Sea Academy are all Level-6","Spiritual Sovereigns. Be careful.”","Feng Wu said, “If I remember it correctly, you said that Princess Xuezhen and Murong Linan of the Murong family are going to have a marriage alliance.”","Luo Zilin nodded. “That’s right. With the help of Princess Royal and Lord Yan, the marriage between Princess Xuezhen and Murong Linan is getting more and more certain. They’ve met each other in the past three months, and I heard that Princess Xuezhen liked the arrangement. The two families are only waitinz for the official announcement.","“Of course, Princess Xuezhen’s preference isn’t the point. The news only means one thing. The Murong family has been roped in by the royal family. Once they get married, they’ll become an alliance.","“The royal family has roped in the Primordial Pagoda, and the Murong family will have fewer neutral members left. The Luo family will become more and more passive...” Luo Zilin sighed.","“According to insider information, the winner of the Dragon Gate Banquet is going to be Murong Linan. He’s going to propose to Princess Xuezhen with the broken star piece.”","Feng Wu smiled. “Don’t worry. He wouldn’t propose with a broken star piece. That’s never going to happen.”","Luo Zilin asked, “Really? Why?”","Feng Wu said, “Because this broken star piece is mine.”","All four broken star pieces had appeared.","Feng Wu had the first piece, the second piece would come from the Twelve Trials of Love, and her third senior brother had the third piece. The fourth piece was going to be in the Dragon Gate Banquet.","“By the way, all your friends are coming,” Luo Zilin told Feng Wu. Feng Wu’s eyes lit up. “Are you talking about Feng Xun and the others?”","Luo Zilin nodded. “You’ve been cultivating in seclusion for the past three months, so you don’t know what’s going on outside. In fact, your friends have been making rapid progress. I have to admit that they’ve all chosen the right sect, which is the most beneficial to their cultivation.."]},{"number":4206,"title":"Chapter 4206: Dragon Gate Banquet (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4206: Dragon Gate Banquet (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The Dragon Gate Banquet was tomorrow.","Therefore, many people entered the imperial capital today.","The royal family, Lord Yan’s residence, and the Luo family were all in the imperial capital. Sacred Mu Cliff never participated in such things, so no one came.","Of the six major forces, the Mountain Sea Academy was the first to arrive. The team was led by the principal of the school. Qiu Zhennan, Liang Jin, Zhao Xin, and Ji Xingcheng were all here. Of course, Feng Xun was also here.","The Murong family sent Murong Linan and Murong Linhai. It was said that Murong Linan had met the princess and enjoyed the conversation.","The leader of the Formless Sword Sect, Ye Buqi, was also here. His disciple Ye Yijian, the sacred son, and Ye Erjian were also here. Of course, Xuan Yi was with them.","The Red Feather Room was led by Master Chilian, and Fairy Ziyun was here. Of course, Chaoge was with them.","The abbot and the monks of the Primordial Pagoda were here, but the Valley of Medicine Masters never sent anyone.","Immediately, the imperial capital was filled with talented people.","“I’m going out.” Hearing that someone from the Red Feather Room was there, Feng Wu picked up a steamed bun, threw it in her mouth, and dashed off. Luo Zilin followed her. “Why are you running so fast? Where are you going?”","Feng Wu said as she ran, “I’m going to see Chaoge. People of the Red Feather Room have already moved into the Fairy’s Room. It’s been a while since I last saw her. I wonder if she’s been bullied in the Red Feather Room.”","Luo Zilin said, “Wait. I’ll go with you.","Feng Wu looked over her shoulder. “Didn’t my uncle tell you to stay at home and cultivate?”","Luo Zilin said, “I’ve been cultivating all the time, so I should at least get some fresh air.”","Feng Wu suddenly smiled. “Luo Zilin, you’ve made some progress recently, haven’t you? Are you at Level 4?”","Luo Zilin didn’t know what to say. “You’re almost at Level 7, but I’m still Level","Is that a compliment?”","Feng Wu gloated. “Well, I’m the best. The blood pool has helped me a lot. Thank you.”","Luo Zilin said grumpily, “You did well, didn’t you? I went in as well, but I only made one breakthrough.”","Feng Wu said, “Isn’t one level enough? My uncle said that one breakthrough is already an outstanding achievement.”","Luo Zilin said, “That depends on who I’m compared to.”","Feng Wu said, “Why do you have to compete with me? It’s so frustrating to lose.","Why do you do that?”","Luo Zilin crossed his arms and snorted.","Feng Wu patted him on the shoulder. “There, there. I won’t upset you. I’ve recently figured out a new breathing cultivation technique that’ll help with my breakthrough. Come, I’ll tell you as we walk.”","Luo Zilin was pleasantly surprised.","Back in the Junwu Empire, Luo Zilin was able to keep an eye on Feng Wu. Who would have thought that Feng Wu was already way ahead of him now?","Feng Wu told Luo Zilin about her new cultivation technique, and he was pleasantly surprised because he realized that it could really improve his cultivation level.","It would be great if he could make a breakthrough before the Dragon Gate Banquet.","The Dragon Gate Banquet was the same as the imperial exam. One had to be on the Dragon’s Gate List.","How did the four major clans and six major forces compete? In the early years, they had to rely on the most capable cultivators in their clans. However, in recent years, new competitions had been introduced, and the competition was about the capability of the new generation.","Whichever force didn’t have a new member in the Dragon Gate Banquet would be disadvantageous to the family clan’s ranking.","Apart from the Sacred Mu Cliff.","The Medicine God Valley, which had always been above all other forces, was also an exception.."]},{"number":4207,"title":"Chapter 4207: Dragon Gate Banquet (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4207: Dragon Gate Banquet (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","While Luo Zilin was making progress, Feng Wu went to see Duan Chaoge in the","Red Feather Room.","Feng Wu heard a hubbub of voices before she got close enough.","What was going on? Feng Wu frowned.","Therefore, she jumped over the wall instead of going in through the front gate.","Before, Feng Wu would have been discovered if she jumped over the wall, but she was no longer what she used to be. After all the improvements, the Red Feather Room had focused all its attention on the front yard, so no one noticed that Feng Wu had come in","“Duan Chaoge, who the hell do you think you are( How dare you steal my senior sister’s spotlight?!” Someone scolded her. At the same time, the sound of a whip rang out. “If you’re so capable, come. Let me see how capable you are now!”","Whoosh!","There was the sound of someone snapping a whip.","Chaoge stared at the woman in the green dress in displeasure. “My master told me to register for the Dragon Gate Banquet. Why are you angry at me?”","Chaoge hated it when girls got jealous of each other, so she only liked hanging out with Feng Wu. She wouldn’t have gone to the Red Feather Room if the manual didn’t suit her.","“Heh, you? You’re not a Spiritual Saint at all! Why would my master let you participate? And why would she make you the No. 2 candidate for the sacred lady? I don’t believe it! You must have bewitched my master! Cut the crap and fight me!” The woman wouldn’t let Chaoge off the hook.","Chaoge had always been short-tempered, and she smirked at that girl’s provocation. “Bring it on. I’m not afraid of you.”","Chaoge used her sword, and the woman used her whip.","Both used techniques from the Red Feather Room.","One was a new member of the Red Feather Room, and the other one was a Senior Martial Sister. Needless to say, everyone thought highly of Senior Sister Wang.","Chaoge and Senior Sister Wang were engaged in a fierce battle. Many female disciples of the Red Feather Room were watching and discussing among themselves.","Feng Wu listened carefully and realized that everyone was still hostile toward","Duan Chaoge.","“Isn’t Duan Chaoge from some wild land? Why is she so arrogant?”","“That’s right. I don’t know what Master is thinking, but she has raised Duan Chaoge’s status so much all of a sudden. I can’t believe that she’s one of the candidates for the sacred lady.”","“No wonder Senior Sister Wang lost their temper. She was supposed to be the second-best candidate, but now, Duan Chaoge has usurped her position.”","“Why did I hear that Duan Chaoge is so talented? My master once told me that she’s a rare genius!”","“What genius? She’s about the same age as us. She wasn’t even as capable as us when she first joined the sect. If you ask me, she must be... That’s why Master takes such good care of her.”","“That’s right. She has to be Master’s illegitimate daughter. That’s why she cares about her so much. Otherwise, we won’t be able to explain why she’s so biased toward her.”","“Do you think Senior Martial Sister Wang will win?”","“Of course! Senior Sister Wang will definitely win!”","Just then, with a crack, the whip in Senior Sister Wang’s hand was thrown out. Chaoge then pointed her sword at Senior Sister Wang’s neck.","“Do you admit your defeat?” Chaoge smirked at Senior Sister Wang.","Everyone was dumbfounded.","What was going on?","They remembered that Duan Chaoge wasn’t their match when she joined the sect. How did she become so capable all of a sudden? How could she defeat Senior Sister Wang?","Senior Sister Wang was quite capable among the Red Feather Room’s disciples.","“What are you doing?!” A cold voice rang out.."]},{"number":4208,"title":"Chapter 4208: Red Feather Room (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4208: Red Feather Room (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“What are you doing?!” A cold voice rang out.","Everyone turned around and cried out in surprise. “Senior Sister Ziyun.”","It was none other than Ziyun, the senior sister and the sacred lady of the Red Feather Room.","She frowned and looked displeased. “What happened?”","When Duan Chaoge let his guard down, Senior Sister Wang suddenly jumped up and shot a packet of white powder at Chaoge.","Chaoge sent Senior Sister Wang flying in time, but the white powder still landed on her.","“What are you doing?!” Chaoge bellowed at Senior Sister Wang.","Meanwhile, Senior Sister Wang spat out a mouthful of blood and pointed at Chaoge. “You tried to kill me... Duan Chaoge, you’re so evil!”","After that, she fainted.","Immediately, everyone in the Red Feather Room cried out in surprise.","Ziyun also rushed over to check her pulse. She blanched. “Wang Lin! Wang Lin”","However, no matter how loudly she shouted, Senior Sister Wang showed no sign of waking up.","“She’s not breathing! There’s no pulse either! Is Senior Sister Wang dead?” One of the junior sisters behind Ziyun cried out.","Everyone panicked.","Conflicts and fights were real, but if someone died in a sect fight, then...","“Duan Chaoge, you killed Senior Sister Wang! You’re so dead!”","Zhang Ke, the junior sister next to Ziyun, bellowed at Chaoge. She then rushed into the room and shouted, “Master! Master!”","Chaoge was dumbfounded. She looked at her hands in bewilderment.","She had pushed Senior Sister Wang away in a moment of desperation. Had she really used all her strength when she killed Senior Sister Wang?","Ziyun put down Senior Sister Wang and gave the order. “Arrest Duan Chaoge!”","Immediately, two senior sisters of the Red Feather Room tried to grab Duan Chaoge.","However, if Duan Chaoge could be caught so easily, she wouldn’t be Chaoge anymore. With a wave of her hand, the two of them stumbled back.","“Duan Chaoge, how dare you resist arrest after killing Wang Lin!” Ziyun was furious. “Take her down! Everyone! I don’t care if you have to kill her!”","After all, Chaoge was a new member of Red Feather Room, whereas the other had been here for many years and had formed a team. Now that the new member had killed a senior member of the team, they all treated her like an enemy.","Moreover, Ziyun shouted, “Do you think you can look down on other Red Feather Room disciples just because Master is biased toward you and told you to start cultivating as soon as you joined the sect? Duan Chaoge, you’re so arrogant!”","What she said was so provocative.","All the disciples of Red Feather Room had to work very hard to become inner sect disciples. Only then were they qualified to cultivate the basic cultivation techniques of the Red Feather Room, and it would take them many years to become a core disciple. Only then would they be qualified to cultivate the ultimate skills.","Chaoge, on the other hand, had started cultivating as soon as she got here, and her master had taught her in person. Not only did Chaoge take advantage of the situation, but she had also disrespected her senior sisters. They felt that Ziyun was right. Chaoge was too arrogant!","Immediately, the students of the Red Feather Room were infuriated.","Chaoge, on the other hand, was a very straightforward person. She focused on her cultivation and wasn’t good at trickery.."]},{"number":4209,"title":"Chapter 4209: Red Feather Room (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4209: Red Feather Room (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Miss Qingluan knew what Chaoge was like, which was why she dared to pick on her.","However, Duan Chaoge was much more capable than when she first joined the sect. Therefore, when the six Red Feather Room disciples charged at her, Chaoge easily knocked them away.","“I didn’t kill her! You can’t accuse me like that!” Chaoge wasn’t good at making excuses, so she kept repeating those words.","“Senior Sister?”","Seeing that they couldn’t take down Duan Chaoge, the others turned around and gave Ziyun pleading looks.","Ziyun smirked and waved at Chaoge.","After all, the sacred lady Ziyun was the eldest pupil of the Red Feather Room, and Chaoge wasn’t her match. With a thump, Chaoge was sent flying!","“Take her down!” Ziyun stood in mid-air with an arrogant look on her face.","“Yes!”","The audience all looked at her in admiration.","The sacred lady was going to be the future successor of Red Feather Room. How amazing!","They were about to take Duan Chaoge down when they heard a voice behind her.","“I’d like to see you try!”","It was Feng Wu.","Chaoge’s stomach lurched when she heard that familiar voice. Turning around, she saw that it was Feng Wu, and she cried out in delight. “Xiao Wu!”","Chaoge coughed so hard that she thought she was going to cough her lungs out. She only stopped after spitting out a mouthful of blood.","Feng Wu went up to Chaoge and saw the blood on her chest. She wiped the blood off her mouth and said coldly, “Don’t worry. I’m here.”","“I really didn’t want to kill Senior Sister Wang,” Chaoge said stubbornly. Feng Wu rubbed her head. “I believe you.”","To Chaoge, those words were the most powerful words in the world. Tears welled up in her eyes and she felt wronged.","Feng Wu patted Chaoge’s head again before standing up and looking at the sacred lady.","Meanwhile, all eyes were on Feng Wu, as was the sacred lady Ziyun.","Ziyun recognized Feng Wu, so she frowned and said arrogantly, “How dare you meddle in the Red Feather Room’s business? I was wondering who it was, but it was you.”","Back on Dynasty Road, the sacred lady Ziyun had heard Feng Wu’s name from other people.","However, Feng Wu’s team won without Feng Wu’s intervention, so the sacred lady Ziyun didn’t know how capable Feng Wu really was.","Feng Wu said indifferently, “It’s me.”","Ziyun frowned a little. “Feng Wu, I know you’re a member of the Luo family, and you’re a long-lost bloodline. I don’t want to become enemies with the Luo family, so please stay out of it.”","She thought, “It means that you’re not important enough, but I also admit that the Luo family is powerful enough. So, don’t get involved in other sects just because you’re a member of the Luo family.”","Feng Wu smiled. “I’m not here on behalf of the Luo family. I’m here on my own.”","Ziyun asked, “On your own behalf?”","Feng Wu nodded. “That’s right. I’m only intervening on my own behalf.”","Ziyun asked, “Are you sure you want to get involved?”","Feng Wu said, “I can’t stand it when good people get wronged, and I can’t stand Chaoge saying that she’s wronged either.”","Ziyun was angry, so what if she couldn’t stand it? There were so many things in this world that she couldn’t stand it. If it wasn’t for Luo Zilin, she wouldn’t have talked to Feng Wu for so long.."]},{"number":4210,"title":"Chapter 4210: Chilian, Jinghui, Ziyun, Wang Lin, Zhang Ke","paragraphs":["Chapter 4210: Chilian, Jinghui, Ziyun, Wang Lin, Zhang Ke","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Ziyun the sacred lady smirked. “The Red Feather Room isn’t some petty sect. If you’re going to get involved, you’ll have to pay for it!”","Feng Wu nodded. “Alright.”","“After you.”","“After you.”","Feng Wu and the sacred lady Ziyun said in unison. The next second, they struck out.","As a matter of fact, Feng Wu had roughly guessed Ziyun’s cultivation level when she attacked Chaoge.","The sacred lady Ziyun wasn’t weak, but she wasn’t very capable either.","She was a Level-5 Spiritual Emperor, slightly higher than Luo Zilin and about the same level as Luo Zizhong.","But now, Feng Wu was so capable that the sacred lady Ziyun couldn’t even begin to compare with her. Ever since the Dynasty Road, Feng Wu had been making rapid progress.","Feng Wu could have defeated the sacred lady with one strike, but she didn’t do that.","With the Dragon Gate Banquet coming, Feng Wu would have a death wish if she revealed her capability in advance. Hence, Feng Wu had demonstrated her capability as a Level-5 Spiritual Sovereign.","She exerted the same level of strength as the Ziyun but could easily suppress the latter.","Thump! Thump! Thump!","Feng Wu kicked the sacred lady for 49 times in a row, and each time, she kicked the sacred lady until she flew backward before being pulled back by an invisible force. Then, she kicked the sacred lady away before pulling her back again...","Over and over again...","The crowd was dumbfounded.","“How’s that possible?”","‘What’s going on? Why is our sacred lady...”","“The sacred lady is one of the best cultivators of her generation. How...” Everyone watched this in astonishment and didn’t know how to react.","The sacred lady Ziyun was also dumbfounded. In the end, Feng Wu kicked her from above, and Ziyun fell to the ground.","“You!”","The sacred lady glared at Feng Wu, grinding her teeth so hard that they almost shattered.","Feng Wu clapped her hands and looked at the sacred lady. “Are you not convinced? Do you still want to fight?”","Ziyun wouldn’t accept it, but to keep fighting? She couldn’t fight back at all. “Exactly what level are you?!” The sacred lady glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu didn’t answer. Instead, she asked, “Are you a Level 5 Spiritual Sovereign?”","Ziyun nodded.","Feng Wu said, “Me, too.”","What did she mean by “me, too”? She was obviously not!","“I don’t believe it! You can’t be a Level-5 Spiritual Sovereign! That’s impossible!”","Feng Wu said, “I’m invincible among her peers. Haven’t you heard?” Invincible? The sacred lady was dumbfounded and didn’t know what to say.","“So what if you’re invincible among your peers? So what if you’ve defeated my senior sister? Duan Chaoge has killed Senior Sister Wang and is punishable by death! That’s the rule of the Red Feather Room!” Ziyun’s junior sister said angrily.","The others glared at Feng Wu as well.","“Master is here!”","The others turned around and saw that Zhang Ke had indeed gone to fetch Master Chilian.","Master Chilian wasn’t alone. Master Jinghui was with him.","Master Chilian was relatively calm, but Master Jinghui abhorred evil and was very impatient.","Their names were what their masters entrusted to their personalities, but it also showed what they were like.","Before Master Chilian could say anything, Master Jinghui said angrily, “Is Wang Lin dead?!”"]},{"number":4211,"title":"Chapter 4211: The Red Feather Room (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4211: The Red Feather Room (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Jinghui said angrily, “Is Wang Lin dead?”","“Master, Aunt-Master, Duan Chaoge killed Senior Sister Wang Lin. We saw it with our own eyes!”","“Yes! We all saw it with our own eyes! It can’t be fake!”","“Master, a life for a life. Isn’t that the rule of the Red Feather Room? Are you going to take Duan Chaoge’s side?”","Master Chilian turned to Chaoge with a stern look on his face. “What do you","Chaoge gritted her teeth and remained silent.","“Master, she killed Senior Sister Wang Lin. What can she say?”","Chaoge said angrily, “She sprinkled powder on me first!”","Zhang Ke said, “Did you think you could kill her just because she sprinkled powder on you?!”","Chaoge said, “I thought it was poisonous!”","Zhang Ke said, “But aren’t you standing here? Where’s the poison?”","Chaoge was speechless.","Zhang Ke said, “You’re the one who murdered Senior Sister Wang Lin! Duan Chaoge, you’re so evil! How can the Red Feather Room have someone like you?!”","Zhang Ke turned to Master Chilian and said, “Master, please bring justice for Senior Sister Wang Lin.”","Ziyun glanced at the others.","Immediately, many Red Feather Room disciples bowed at Master Chilian. “Master, please don’t let Senior Sister Wang Lin down.”","It wasn’t a request, but a threat.","Master Chilian looked at Chaoge.","Chaoge said stubbornly, “I didn’t do it!”","“Then why is Wang Lin dead? Why are so many of them calling you a murderer? Did they agree to become a witness together?!” Master Jinghui threw a dirty look at Chaoge, then turned to Master Chilian. “I’ve always said that Duan Chaoge is a disaster. We shouldn’t have brought her here in the first place. Senior Sister, we’re in trouble now.”","Master Chilian shook his head and sighed.","Feng Wu didn’t rush to Chaoge’s side because she wanted to see what kind of attitude the Red Feather Room had. Right now, most people had shown negative attitudes toward Chaoge, and Master Chilian was the only one left.","Master Chilian glanced at Duan Chaoge and shook his head. “You’ve disappointed me.”","Chaoge burst into tears.","Only a handful of people in this world had been kind to her, and Master Chilian had been treating Duan Chaoge with all her heart. But now, even she had said such things...","“No, I didn’t! I didn’t want to kill her! She started it!” Chaoge wouldn’t stop repeating those words.","But no one would believe her.","Feng Wu felt sorry for Chaoge. If Wang Lin really died today, she wouldn’t be able to explain herself.","“As a matter of fact, Chaoge has indeed defeated Wang Lin and let her off the hook. After that, Wang Lin ambushed her, didn’t she?” Feng Wu finally stepped out. Crossing her arms, she casually scanned the crowd.","“Why are you still here?! It’s none of your business! Get out of here!” The female cultivators of Red Feather Room held grudges against Feng Wu, for she was practically using Ziyun as her stepping stone.","Feng Wu gave them a half-smile. “Am I seeing things? Didn’t Wang Lin lose the battle? Didn’t he sneak up on Chaoge?”","“Yes, that’s right. It was Senior Sister Wang Lin who challenged Duan Chaoge. After she lost, she tried to ambush Duan Chaoge, but Duan Chaoge was the one who killed her, and that was wrong!” The third senior sister of the Red Feather Room said coldly.","Master Chilian closed her eyes and didn’t say anything.","Feng Wu said, “Wang Lin lost, and Chaoge cut her loose, but she ambushed","Chaoge. She had to have a death wish.. What’s wrong with Chaoge killing her?”"]},{"number":4212,"title":"Chapter 4212: Red Feather Room (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4212: Red Feather Room (5)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Had it not been for Feng Wu’s victory over the sacred lady Ziyun, these people would never have given Feng Wu a chance to speak.","After what Feng Wu said, no one in the Red Feather Room dared to challenge her.","Master Jinghui had no idea of Feng Wu’s cultivation level. She glared at Feng Wu and said, “Who the hell do you think you are? You have no right to speak in the Red Feather Room!”","Feng Wu smiled. “Duan Chaoge is with me. Why can’t I complain when she’s wronged?” Master Jinghui said, “That’s very bold of you. In that case, you can...’","“Wait!”","Master Chilian stopped her when she was about to intervene. He then turned to Feng Wu. “Miss Feng Wu, what happened today has nothing to do with you. It’s a private matter of the Red Feather Room. Miss Feng Wu, please leave.”","Feng Wu chuckled. “I told you that Duan Chaoge is a member of my family, and she’s my business. How can I stay out of it? Moreover, instead of making Chaoge a murderer, why don’t you check if your Senior Sister Wang Lin is really dead?” “What did you say?”","“What do you mean?”","“Senior Sister Wang Lin is dead, and you’re still going to humiliate her like this?”","“You’re so...”","While everyone was criticizing Feng Wu, Feng Wu smiled. “Is your Senior Sister","Wang Lin really dead? She doesn’t look that way to me. It just so happens that I’m an expert in medicine and I know how to treat this fake death. Of course, if your Senior Sister Wang Lin isn’t dead, this needle will destroy all her cultivation achievements.”","After that, Feng Wu took out a thick needle, took off Wang Lin’s shoes and socks, and said, “But please trust me. Put this needle in, and your Senior Sister Wang Lin will wake up.”","But no one would believe Feng Wu.","However, when Feng Wu put the needle in...","There was a scream.","Wang Lin, who had been deemed dead, jumped to her feet and ran in the direction of her master. “Master, help me!”","Everything happened so fast that the others didn’t have time to react.","“She’s not dead?”","“But the sacred lady just said that she’s dead. How can she still be alive?”","Immediately, all eyes were on Ziyun, and the sacred lady wanted to dig a hole and hide in it.","That was right. Everything had been planned by the sacred lady Ziyun, including Wang Lin’s death and Zhang Ke’s visit to her master.","She had thought that with Duan Chaoge’s clumsy way of speech, she would never be able to explain herself, and her master would eventually kick her out of the sect. That wav. Zivun could assassinate Duan Chaoge in secret and make","her disappear from this world. However, the sacred lady had never expected that Feng Wu would show up halfway!","Right now, all eyes were on her, and they all needed an explanation.","“I really thought Wang Lin was dead, and she wasn’t breathing...” The sacred lady was about to explain.","But what she didn’t know was that Feng Wu had drugged Wang Lin with the truth serum when she treated her with acupuncture. That powder was so potent that it could make people tell the truth.","After Feng Wu’s repeated modifications, the powder had become even more potent.","“I don’t know how Wang Lin... It was indeed my fault. Master, please punish me.” Ziyun apologize politely.."]},{"number":4213,"title":"Chapter 4213: Red Feather Room (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4213: Red Feather Room (6)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Master Chilian didn’t want to make a scene, so she decided to let it drop.","Hence, Master Chilian said coldly, “It’s indeed your fault. You’ve wronged your","Junior Sister Chaoge. Go apologize to her!”","The sacred lady went up to Chaoge. “Chaoge...”","Chaoge didn’t want to forgive her, so she kept her face straight and wouldn’t look at her.","Feng Wu smiled a little.","This sacred lady wanted Chaoge dead and was trying to force Chaoge to forgive her. How could it be so easy?","Therefore, Feng Wu snapped her fingers in her sleeves.","It was like a secret signal that was going to set off the truth serum on Wang Lin.","The sacred lady was still trying to explain her innocence to Chaoge, trying to blame it on Wang Lin, when Wang Lin said angrily, “Senior Sister, you planned this all along! How can you say that you don’t know anything?!”","What? Ziyun shuddered when she heard that.","Immediately, the others all stared at Wang Lin and asked her what she meant.","Wang Lin smirked. “Senior Sister has obviously come up with a plan so that Duan Chaoge can jump into it. She hates Duan Chaoge to the bone and wants to kill her. Don’t you know that?”","What?","What?","How could their perfect senior sister do such a thing?","“Wang Lin, that’s bullshit!” The sacred lady wanted to tear Wang Lin’s mouth open.","Wang Lin smirked. “You told me to fight Duan Chaoge, didn’t you? You told me to pretend that Chaoge had killed me! You...”","Wang Lin, who had been drugged with the truth serum, didn’t try to hide anything. She blurted out everything that needed to be said, cornering Ziyun and revealing all her darkest thoughts.","Feng Wu had injured Ziyun, so the latter couldn’t stop Wang Lin.","“You!” Ziyun fainted.","After she passed out, Senior Sister Wang Lin couldn’t withstand the effect of the truth serum and passed out as well.","Seeing the two people lying unconscious on the ground, everyone looked at one another in bewilderment and didn’t know how to react.","Master Chilian and Master Jinghui were equally baffled. In the end, Master Chilian spoke first. “We can’t just believe whatever Wang Lin says. After all, she’s injured. Maybe her brain is damaged, and that’s why she’s making things up..","“Brain injury? If I hadn’t forced Wang Lin to wake up today, what would have happened to Chaoge?” Feng Wu stared at her coldly.","Master Jinghui didn’t know what to say. “I don’t think anything would happen.”","Feng Wu ignored her and went on talking to Master Chilian. “I thought the Red Feather Room was a good place and you were good to Chaoge, which was why I handed her to you. I didn’t expect that she would be bullied like this. If that’s the case, I’ll take her with me. I won’t bother the Red Feather Room anymore.","Goodbye!”","Feng Wu was about to leave with Chaoge.","“Stop!”","Master Chilian blocked her way. “You can take her away.”","Feng Wu smirked. ‘What? You won’t give up until you get Chaoge killed? Do you want her to stay here and get killed by your sacred lady?”","Master Chilian had never been criticized like this before. She was embarrassed.","Master Jinghui glared at Feng Wu.."]},{"number":4214,"title":"Chapter 4214: Who Was Helping Her","paragraphs":["Chapter 4214: Who Was Helping Her","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Jinghui glared at Feng Wu. “You can’t take her away!” Feng Wu asked, “What if I insist?”","Master Jinghui said, “Over my dead body, then!”","Feng Wu smirked. “Do you really think I’m afraid?”","Seeing that a fight was about to break out, Master Chilian felt a headache coming on. She waved her hands and stopped them. “Forget it. It’ll depend on Chaoge. Chaoge, do you want to go with her?”","Chaoge nodded without hesitation. “I want to go with Xiao Wu.”","“You Master Chilian almost choked. She knew that Chaoge might leave, but she didn’t expect Chaoge to do it without hesitation...","‘You haven’t finished your cultivation yet. It’s not the right time to leave.”","Master Chilian frowned. “For the sake of your future, you’d better stay in the Red Feather Room. Don’t worry. After this, your senior sisters won’t do anything to you. I...”","Feng Wu gave it some thought and decided that it wouldn’t be a good idea for Chaoge to leave now. The manual for Red Feather Room was the most suitable for Chaoge. If she left before she finished it...","Feng Wu asked, “Are you really coming with me?”","Chaoge nodded. “I’ll follow you wherever you go. Xiao Wu, let’s stay together, okay?”","Rubbing her temple, Feng Wu asked, “How long do you have before you finish learning the cultivation technique?”","“A month,” said Master Chilian. “Chaoge is very talented, and she’ll be able to learn all the cultivation techniques in a month. All she needs to do from now on is to improve on her own.”","Feng Wu pulled Chaoge to the side and taught her how to cultivate as fast as she could. It was the one that she had taught Luo Zilin.","“Alright. I’ll remember that.” Chaoge had a good memory for cultivation.","Feng Wu nodded. “I’ll take you away in a month.”","In the end, Chaoge had no choice but to watch Feng Wu leave.","After Feng Wu left, she went to Feng Xun and the others to teach them how to speed up their cultivation. Although they were already considered fast cultivators in their own sects, with the Dragon Gate Banquet around the corner, they could still make some progress.","To Feng Wu’s surprise, after visiting several sects and teaching her friends, something happened to her on her way back. In the dark alley, the sound of raindrops filled the air.","The atmosphere of the assassination was very tense.","A blade struck down at the back of Feng Wu’s neck.","Feng Wu only realized what had happened when the blade almost brushed past her throat, but it was too late.","Feng Wu dodged, but the blade still cut her skin.","The mark was very shallow because Feng Wu dodged in time.","If Feng Wu were any slower, she would have been decapitated.","Who did it?","Instantly, Feng Wu’s heart raced.","Although Feng Wu had shown Ziyun that she was a Level-5 Spiritual Sovereign, she was actually a Level-7 one.","Even so, someone was still able to approach her without making a sound. One strike and she was almost dead.","That person was more capable than she was.","To Feng Wu’s surprise, her opponent could have struck out a second time after the first one, but no matter how long she waited, the second strike never came.","The assassin didn’t make another move until she was gone.","Smelling the blood, Feng Wu ran to a hidden corner and saw a man in black lying there on the ground. His bones were almost broken into pieces.."]},{"number":4215,"title":"Chapter 4215: He l s Back","paragraphs":["Chapter 4215: He l s Back","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","All the bones in the man’s body were broken as if he had been squeezed to death.","Feng Wu was at a loss. Who was this man? And who had killed him?","Who was the person that had attacked her just then? Where was he now?","Or was someone secretly helping her?","Feng Wu was filled with questions, but no one told her the answer.","Time flew by and the day of the Dragon Gate Banquet finally arrived.","Luo Zilin ran out in a hurry and whispered something in Feng Wu’s ear.","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up. “Really?”","“Of course. Why would I lie to you?” Crossing his arms proudly, Luo Zilin glanced at Feng Wu.","“By the way, did you know? That person is back.” Luo Zilin had a solemn look on his face.","Feng Wu was at a loss.","“Who’s that?” Feng Wu looked at him in bewilderment.","Luo Zilin said, “The crown prince, the legendary crown prince! He’s back!”","“Huh?” Feng Wu looked at him in bewilderment. “What are you talking about?”","Luo Zilin said, “Why aren’t you sensitive to the secret of the royal family at all?","They’re our archenemy, and you have to be very sensitive to your enemies. Got","Feng Wu nudged him. “Fine, fine. I won’t know who the crown prince is until you tell me.”","Luo Zilin said, “His Majesty’s fourth son was the empress’s son, and he was made the crown prince as soon as he was born. However, he died a few days later.”","Feng Wu asked, “Is that so?”","Luo Zilin said, “But according to my family’s secret investigation, His Royal Highness isn’t dead, but has been taken away for some special reason. Now, he’s finally back to the royal family.”","Feng Wu said, “Isn’t the crown prince supposed to be the eldest prince?”","Luo Zilin smirked. “Even His Majesty thought that the crown prince was dead, so he made the eldest prince his heir to the throne. Now that the crown prince is still alive and has shown up, we’ll have a great show to watch. The more they fight, the better it’ll be for us.”","Feng Wu asked curiously, “Who’s the new crown prince, then? Have you met him?”","Luo Zilin said, “According to what we’ve been told, His Majesty is the only member of the royal family who has met the crown prince. The empress died because of it. Something must have happened when the crown prince was carried off.”","Feng Wu agreed. “Of course. It’s too strange. No one gets sick for no reason. The empress died of depression, and the emperor still doesn’t know that his son is still alive. There’s a lot of story behind that. But what good will it do to me? Our top priority now is to win the Dragon Gate Banquet.”","If Feng Wu had said that she wanted to be first before, Luo Zilin would have smiled and kept his silence. However, after seeing how fast the girl had been making breakthroughs, Luo Zilin felt that it wasn’t impossible.","“I heard that the new crown prince is also going to the Dragon Gate Banquet.” Luo Zilin stared at Feng Wu. “I heard that he’s very talented. He should be a tough enemy for you.”","Feng Wu raised her head. “I have to get that broken star piece! I’m not going to lose!”","Feng Wu and Luo Zilin headed for the Dragon’s Domain, where the Dragon Gate Banquet was held.","The Dragon Gate Banquet was the most prosperous event in the empire.","Apart from the eldest and second sons of the Luo family, the other two brothers and Feng Wu were all going.."]},{"number":4216,"title":"Chapter 4216: Who Do You Choose (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4216: Who Do You Choose (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“There are a lot of candidates this year. Here’s my list.” Seeing that Feng Wu had come back, Luo Zilin ran to her side.","“Why do you look so pale?” Luo Zilin looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment.","Feng Wu didn’t try to keep it from him. “Someone tried to assassinate me on my way back from the Red Feather Room. ”","Luo Zilin’s face darkened a little. “Are you hurt?”","Feng Wu shook her head. “Don’t worry. I’m fine. That person failed.”","Only then did Luo Zilin let out a breath of relief. “I’m so glad to see that you’re alright! But who was it? Why would they try to kill you at such a critical moment?”","Feng Wu shook her head. “That man took the poison and turned it into a pool of blood. His clothes are gone as well. There’s really nothing left of him.”","What Feng Wu didn’t tell Luo Zilin was that if someone hadn’t saved her in secret, she would have been dead by now.","“If someone did it, they must have left a trace. We have to look into it!” Luo Zilin ran out after that and gave the order. He then told his men to check the alley Feng Wu mentioned.","“By the way, did you mention the name list?” Feng Wu looked at Luo Zilin in bewilderment.","Luo Zilin nodded and handed a thick booklet to Feng Wu. “A total of 600 people are going to attend.”","“600?” Feng Wu’s eyes widened. “There are so many capable cultivators in one year?!”","Luo Zilin smiled. “One only needs to be a Spiritual Sovereign to participate. All the youngsters have fought their way up from all provinces. Each province and sect will send a few people, and there are hundreds of them. However, only the top ten students of the Dragon Gate Banquet will be rewarded, and it’ll be very difficult to get into the top ten. The previous year, the top student was a Level-6 Spiritual Sovereign.”","Feng Wu thought, “I’m better than that.”","As expected, Luo Zilin went on. “There are too many promising candidates this year, so I don’t think a Level-6 Spiritual Sovereign will be enough. Xiao Wu, you have to work harder.”","Feng Wu nodded. She was determined to become the winner, not only because of the Luo family’s ranking but also because of the broken star piece.","“As long as you’re a Level-5 Spiritual Sovereign, you’ll be exempted from the first three trials,” Luo Zilin said excitedly. “I’m at Level 5 now, so I’ll be exempted. Haha, come with me.”","All four members of the Luo family were Level 5 and above, and they were all exempted from the first three trials.","After three rounds, there were only a hundred people left.","However, Feng Xun, Xuan Yi, Chaoge, and Yu Mingye all had to fight to get into the top 100.","To Feng Wu’s surprise, after three rounds, they all made it into the top 100.","“That’s impossible! How can Duan Chaoge get in?” “With her capability, there’s no way...”","There were a lot of protests in the Red Feather Room.","Master Chilian smiled bitterly. Duan Chaoge was more talented than she had expected, and she was very suitable to cultivate in the Red Feather Room. Otherwise, she wouldn’t have been able to make such rapid progress.","However, no matter how hard she tried, the conflict between Ziyun and Chaoge kept getting worse. It was almost irreconcilable.","“Are you sure you can’t get along with her? You’re all disciples of the Red","Feather Room and should work together for the Red Feather Room...”","But before Master Chilian could finish, Fairy Ziyun said coldly, “Master, which one do you choose, me or her?”"]},{"number":4217,"title":"Chapter 4217: Who Do You Choose (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4217: Who Do You Choose (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","But before Master Chilian could finish, Fairy Ziyun said coldly, “Master, which one do you choose, me or her?”","Master Chilian was dumbfounded and stared at Fairy Ziyun.","But Fairy Ziyun wouldn’t give in. She kept her unblinking gaze on Master","Chilian as if she had to force the latter to make a decision.","“Master, who will you choose between me and Duan Chaoge?” she asked, stressing each word.","Master Chilian was displeased. Before she could say anything, Fairy Ziyun said, “Master, if you choose her, I won’t be the sacred lady of the Red Feather Room anymore. I’ll leave from now on.”","“Where are you going after you leave the Red Feather Room?” Master Chilian asked coldly.","Fairy Ziyun only smiled.","It only took Master Chilian a split second to realize what she meant. “The third of the first prince?”","Fairy Ziyun asked, “Have you made up your mind?”","Master Chilian smirked. “I’m never threatened!”","Fairy Ziyun had thought that her master would pick her, but in the end, Master Chilian gave her such an answer.","“So, Master, you’ve chosen Duan Chaoge, haven’t you?” Fairy Ziyun smirked and stared at her master with teary eyes. “Is that your final choice?”","Master Chilian didn’t say anything.","In Fairy Ziyun’s eyes, that was a tacit agreement.","“Good, very good. Master, I didn’t expect that you would choose her in the end.”","Fairy Ziyun smirked. “Duan Chaoge has done her best to make it into the top 100, and she can’t go any further. But I’m already in the top 10 before the competition starts, and you’re still going to choose her. Heh...","Fairy Ziyun smirked again. All of a sudden, she ripped off her jade headband.","“What are you doing there? You saw everything!” Fairy Ziyun stared at the screen behind her master.","Fairy Ziyun already knew that someone was behind the screen, and it was Duan Chaoge.","She had chosen that moment to enter her master’s room to force her master to make a choice. She had thought that her master would choose her no matter what. That way, she would be able to humiliate Duan Chaoge and force her to leave.","But she didn’t expect that she would be the one to be abandoned.","There was a loud smack!","Fairy Ziyun threw the sacred lady of the Red Feather Room’s headband at","Chaoge.","Chaoge grabbed it.","“From now on, I’m no longer a disciple of the Red Feather Room. Master, I hope you won’t regret your decision today! ” Fairy Ziyun turned to leave after that. “Ziyun!” Master Jinghui ran after her.","“Senior Sister!”","The disciples of Red Feather Room called after their senior sister.","Although Ziyun had lost some dignity in the previous incident, she hadn’t been called “Senior Sister” for nothing. Seeing her leave, everyone felt conflicted and turned to look at Master Chilian.","Master Chilian smirked. “Let her go!”","“But...” Master Jinghui’s face darkened. The sacred lady Ziyun was the best member of Red Feather Room this time, and no one else could make it into the top ten. Would the Red Feather Room be demoted if no one else made it?","Master Chilian smirked. “If she’s not sincere, it won’t do her any good even if she joins the battle!”","She left after that.","Master Jinghui looked back at Chaoge and didn’t know what to say. Who would have thought that Chaoge could replace Ziyun, the sacred lady, in such a short time?","She gave Duan Chaoge an indescribable look and went after Master Chilian.."]},{"number":4218,"title":"Chapter 4218: Master!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4218: Master!","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Chaoge watched Master Chilian leave in silence. After some silence, she walked out of the Red Feather Room.","She was looking for Feng Wu.","“Xiao Wu...” Chaoge told Feng Wu what happened in the Red Feather Room. In the end, she asked hesitantly, “Do you think I really forced her to leave?”","“Of course not.” Feng Wu was preparing for the competition the following day, and she stopped to listen to Chaoge’s description when she saw her. In the end, she shook her head affirmatively. “From what I can see, your senior sister has always wanted to leave, but she’s only using this as an excuse.”","“Really? It really wasn’t because of me?” Chaoge was elated.","Feng Wu nodded. “Of course, it wasn’t because of you. Someone like her would never give up her status as the sacred lady of the Red Feather Room for such a petty thing. I’m sure it was for her own good.”","“Who could it be, then?” Chaoge asked.","Feng Wu shook her head. “I don’t know how, but she won’t be able to keep it a","secret for long. We’ll see. I didn’t know that your master wouldn’t let her have her way. I underestimated the Master Chilian.”","“Master is a very good master,” Chaoge said earnestly.","Feng Wu stroked her hair. “I see. Your master is a great master. I’ll give her a hand when I have the chance.”","“Yes!” Chaoge nodded earnestly as if Feng Wu really would do that.","Feng Wu smiled bitterly. “You really do trust me. I’m nowhere near as capable as she is now. How am I supposed to help her?”","“You’ll be the best one day,” Chaoge said confidently.","“By the way, the competition is tomorrow. Xiao Wu, how are you doing?” Chaoge asked anxiously.","Feng Wu said, “You sound as if you don’t need any preparation. I’m not worried about myself. How’s your preparation going?”","Chaoge said, “Master said that I was lucky to be in the top 100 this time. I don’t think I’ll have a chance in the top 50, but...”","“But what?”","Chaoge said hesitantly, “But my senior sister has withdrawn from the Red Feather Room just like that, and there are too few talented people of her generation. If I’m the only one in the top 100 in the Red Feather Room in the end... I don’t want to embarrass my master.”","Feng Wu said, “It’s not just a matter of embarrassment. Red Feather Room’s status will plummet because of this battle. After all, if only one disciple is in the top 100, they won’t be qualified to call themselves one of the ten major sects.”","“What should we do, then?” Chaoge asked anxiously.","Feng Wu said, “You’ll have to work harder, then. You’re the only hope of the","Red Feather Room.”","“But I, I...” Chaoge knew her level very well. She was already very lucky to be in the top 100, and there was nothing she could do to get in the top 50.","“Junior Sister, there you are! Come back with me! Master is looking for you!” A female disciple of Red Feather Room arrived in a hurry and reached out to take","Chaoge’s hand.","“Master is looking for me?” Chaoge was surprised.","“Come with me! We don’t have time for this!”","Chaoge was quickly dragged away by her senior sister. To her surprise, her master had actually come up with a way to improve her cultivation level.","“M- Master? That won’t do. That won’t do.” Chaoge was astonished when she heard her master’s suggestion. “That won’t do! There has to be another way.” Her master was going to give her cultivation achievements to Chaoge.."]},{"number":4219,"title":"Chapter 4219: Cultivation Imparting","paragraphs":["Chapter 4219: Cultivation Imparting","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Master Chilian gave Chaoge a long look. If there was another way, would she choose to impart her cultivation skills to Chaoge?","“Sit down.” Master Chilian took a deep breath and gestured at Chaoge to sit down on the rush cushion in front of her.","“That’s our only option now.","“Don’t say no yet. I don’t have the energy to explain to you.","“All you need to know is that if you’re not in the top ten, I’ll have your head!”","Top ten?","Chaoge was so anxious that she almost fainted.","With her current capability, she had only gotten into the first 100 because she was lucky enough to get the bye draw. However, her master had just told her to get into the top ten...","“Remember. Defeat Ziyun, you have to defeat her!”","After that, Master Chilian began to teach Chaoge without giving her any chance to react.","One night passed...","Apart from Luo Zibo and Luo Ziji, Luo Zizhong, Luo Zilin, and Feng Wu were all at the Dragon Gate Banquet.","The top 100 candidates finally made it to the imperial capital and became outstanding members of the younger generation.","The host of the Dragon Gate Banquet was the Princess Royal.","Right now, the Princess Royal stood proudly in the host seat in a blue dress and looked calmly at the audience.","Standing on the high platform, she glanced at the outstanding youngsters. When she looked at Feng Wu, she smirked.","Feng Wu!","The combination of old and new grudges made the princess’s face darken, but she still looked away without batting an eyelash.","“There’s no need to say more. The competition will be divided into four groups. I’m going to randomly place the cards, and the person will be divided into four groups.”","Everyone started talking after they heard what the Princess Royal said.","Because this wasn’t the first Dragon Gate Banquet, and everyone knew the rules. Before, everyone had to choose their own cards, but this time, it was the Princess Royal’s turn.","“Is that fair?” “What if we’re in the death group?”","“What’s that?”","“You don’t know? By ‘death group,’ it means that the group is filled with capable cultivators, and they’re all fighting against each other. We’re divided into four groups. For instance, if all the capable cultivators are in the sky group, it’ll be very unfair to the members in that group.”","“That’s right. Why does the Princess Royal have to do it this time?”","The Princess Royal looked around and said indifferently, “Although we’re dealing the cards, we have to be fair and open. Therefore, Your Royal Highness, please shuffle the cards.”","In front of the Princess Royal was a big desk with black ink plates on it.","“Moreover, I, Lord Yan, and Luo Nantian are going to draw at the same time. Is that fair?” The Princess Royal narrowed her eyes.","“That’s the fairest decision!” Many people agreed.","Feng Wu glanced at her uncle involuntarily.","Luo Nantian looked back at her in a calm way.","The cards were soon given out.","“Xiao Wu, Xiao Wu, what card did you get?” Chaoge asked Feng Wu excitedly.","Feng Wu said, “I’m in the Yellow Group.”","Chaoge sighed. “But I’m in the Sky Group..”"]},{"number":4220,"title":"Chapter 4220: Groups","paragraphs":["Chapter 4220: Groups","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Luo Zilin chuckled. “Isn’t it nice to be in the Sky Group? You wouldn’t have run into Xiao Wu.” Feng Wu then turned to Luo Zilin. “What about you?”","Luo Zilin shrugged. “I’m not as lucky as Duan Chaoge. Just like you, I’m in the","Yellow Group.”","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes and had a bad feeling.","As expected, Luo Zizhong and Luo Zilin soon arrived, and Feng Wu asked them about their grouping.","“Are you both in the Yellow Group?” Feng Wu looked at her two brothers.","Luo Zizhong and Luo Zilin nodded, then asked Feng Wu. Luo Zilin was furious when he heard that Feng Wu was also a member of the Yellow Group. ‘What kind of luck is it to put all three of us in the same group? Someone must be behind this! No, we can’t let this drop!”","After that, Luo Zilin rolled up his sleeves and was going to start a fight.","Feng Wu stopped him and said indifferently, “Who are you going to reason with?”","Luo Zilin said, “Of course, it’s the Princess Royal! She’s behind it!”","Feng Wu asked, “Where’s your proof?”","Luo Zilin said, “I don’t need any proof! It’s so obvious! Princess Royal has held grudges against you and the Luo family for a very long time!” Feng Wu frowned and asked again, “Where’s your proof?”","Luo Zilin didn’t know what to say.","Feng Wu said, “My uncle was a part of the deal. If he didn’t notice it, it means something. ”","The others turned to Feng Wu in unison. “What is it?”","Feng Wu said, “That’s enough to prove that the Princess Royal has a lot of tricks up her sleeves. Why don’t we go ask my uncle first?”","Luo Zilin nodded immediately. “Yes, let’s go!”","Feng Wu said, “You guys go ahead. I’ll go find Feng Xun and the others.”","Seeing that Luo Zilin and the others had arrived, Luo Nantian knew what they wanted to ask. He waved at them and said, “Let’s go home first.”","Meanwhile, Feng Wu was meeting up with Feng Xun, Xuan Yi, and Yu Mingye.","“Xiao Wu, which group are you in?” Feng Xun asked eagerly.","Before Feng Wu could say anything, Chaoge interjected. “Xiao Wu is a member of the Yellow Group and I’m a member of the Sky Group! What about you?”","“What?!” Feng Xun and the others drew in their breaths. “Xiao Wu is a member of the Yellow Group? What a coincidence!”","Feng Wu frowned. “Are you members of the Yellow Group as well?”","“That’s right!” Feng Xun said in astonishment. “Xuan Yi and Yu Mingye looked at each other’s tokens before you arrived. Yu Mingye is in the Earth Group, but Xuan Yi and I both belong to the Yellow Group as well! I didn’t know that Xiao Wu was a member of the Yellow Group too. How did this happen?”","Chaoge was even angrier. “Xiao Wu isn’t the only one! The two brothers of the Luo family are members of the Yellow Group as well! Most of us have been assigned to the Yellow Group, and it’s obvious that the Princess Royal is targeting us!”","Yu Mingye said, “Luckily, I’m not in the Yellow Group.”","Feng Xun said grumpily, “Your Royal Highness probably thinks that you can still be roped in.”","Yu Mingye smiled wryly. He didn’t join the royal family to work for them.","“Let’s go back to the Luo family first.” Feng Wu nodded at the others. She then looked at Yu Mingye and whispered something in his ear.","Yu Mingye’s eyes lit up when he heard that and he kept his unblinking gaze on","Feng Wu. “Alright. I’ll do as you say.”","Hearing that, Feng Xun patted Yu Mingye on the shoulder. “Of course, you have to listen to Xiao Wu, but can you blink a little? Xiao Wu is no longer available.”","Yu Mingye snorted. “Not necessarily.”","He turned to leave after that.","“Hey, that Yu Mingye...” Feng Xun stomped his foot in frustration as he pointed at Yu Mingye’s back.. ‘What’s that supposed to mean?”"]},{"number":4221,"title":"Chapter 4221: Back to the Luo Family","paragraphs":["Chapter 4221: Back to the Luo Family","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","They went to see Luo Nantian after they got back.","“That’s right. The Princess Royal has tampered with it.” Luo Nantian smiled bitterly and said to Feng Wu, “She only wants us to fight among ourselves, but there’s also a benefit.”","“There’s more to it?” Luo Zilin asked anxiously.","Luo Nantian nodded. “The benefit is that we can make sure that one of us makes it to the top 16.”","There were four groups of four people each, and they would compete for the top eight.","“If it’s done properly, the Luo family can send two people in.” Luo Nantian smiled at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu took the hint right away. After some hesitation, she smiled as well. “Uncle, you’re right.”","Luo Zilin asked anxiously, ‘What do you mean? Why can’t I understand you?”","Feng Wu smiled at him. “Don’t worry. I understand.”","Luo Zilin said, “What?”","The competition between the top 16 went on.","In the end, as Feng Wu expected, she made it into the top 16. Luo Zizhong was another candidate.","Neither Xuan Yi nor Feng Xun went in, nor did Luo Zilin.","The three brothers sighed in unison.","Luo Zilin smiled bitterly. “It’s only natural that you didn’t get in, but neither did","That was so frustrating.”","Feng Xun wouldn’t have it. “Why shouldn’t we get in?”","Luo Zilin said, “Do you remember when we were in the Junwu Empire? Do you remember what level you and I were? You’re almost as capable as me now!","That’s outrageous!”","Feng Xun gave it some thought and agreed with him.","Back in the Junwu Empire, Luo Zilin didn’t care about him at all.","Back then, Feng Xun was no more than an ant to him. But now, he was only three levels away from Luo Zilin. As long as he worked hard enough, he would catch up with Luo Zilin!","“Luo Zilin, you’re making some slow progress,” Feng Xun said casually.","Luo Zilin was furious.","What did he mean by “a little slow”? As a matter of fact, he was already making very fast progress. It was just that Feng Xun and the others had been making such rapid progress that it made him seem slow.","Luo Zilin didn’t want to talk to Feng Xun and Xuan Yi anymore.","However, Feng Xun moved closer and put a hand on his shoulder. “Let’s go have a look. Yu Mingye is in this group. I don’t think he’ll be able to get in either.”","But in fact...","“No way!”","Feng Xun’s eyes widened when he saw the list. “Yu Mingye is in! He’s on the list! t,","“Let me have a look!” Xuan Yi moved closer and saw that Yu Mingye was indeed on the list. “How did that happen?”","“What’s wrong with that? It’s only normal that he gets in,” Luo Zilin said grumpily.","“But he’s not even as good as you. You didn’t even get in, but he did.”","Luo Zilin said, “The strength of each group varies. If we’re unlucky enough, we’ll run into the death group. For instance, it’s very difficult for us to qualify. But Yu Mingye is in the Earth Group, which is the weakest of the four. That’s why he qualified.”","“I see.” Feng Xun rubbed his chin. ‘Yu Mingye used to work for the eldest prince of the royal family, and he helped Yu Mingye qualify, didn’t he? But the royal family and your family are enemies... Has Yu Mingye become one of them?”","Just then, a figure appeared in front of them.."]},{"number":4222,"title":"Chapter 4222: Top Sixteen to Top Eight","paragraphs":["Chapter 4222: Top Sixteen to Top Eight","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","It was none other than Yu Mingye himself.","Feng Xun was in a hurry to question Yu Mingye, but before he could say anything, Yu Mingye had left with the crown prince.","Feng Xun was rendered speechless.","“What are you thinking?” Feng Wu patted Feng Xun on the back.","Feng Xun dragged Feng Wu to a corner and whispered, “Xiao Wu, I need to tell you something!”","Seeing how nervous he was, Feng Wu was amused. “Go ahead.”","Feng Xun said, “Stop laughing! I have something very serious to tell you!”","Fenz Wu smiled. “Go ahead.”","Feng Xun said, ‘Yu Mingye is qualified.”","Feng Wu was surprised. “With his capability, can he pass?”","Feng Xun said, “His team is the weakest of them all, so he was one of the last two to get in. Don’t you find it strange?”","Feng Wu asked, “Is that so?”","Feng Xun said, “When we were divided into groups, all of us were in the Yellow Group, but Yu Mingye was in the weakest Earth Group. I wouldn’t believe it if the royal family didn’t intervene, but if they did... it would mean that Yu Mingye is very close to them. If he has pledged his allegiance to the royal family, it would make him our enemy!” Feng Wu nodded. “That’s right.”","That was right?","Feng Xun stared at Feng Wu in disbelief, for Feng Wu sounded as if it was the right thing to do.","“But, he came here with us from the Junwu Empire. How could he betray us? I...” Feng Xun wanted to rush out.","Feng Wu stopped him. “Where are you going?”","Feng Xun didn’t even look back. “I’m going to Yu Mingye!”","Xuan Yi thought that Feng Wu would stop Feng Xun, but she didn’t.","“Are you going to let him go just like that?” Crossing his arms, Xuan Yi gave Feng Wu a suspicious look. Feng Wu nodded. “Should I have stopped him?”","Xuan Yi was speechless.","He gave Feng Wu another suspicious look. He didn’t know what Feng Wu was up to, but he felt that there was something wrong with Feng Wu’s behavior...","Before Xuan Yi could figure it out, the result of the competition was out.","Feng Xun took Feng Wu’s hand in excitement. “Xiao Wu, you’re in! You’re in the top eight!”","Those who could make it into the top eight were all geniuses of the Dayan","Empire and were definitely outstanding members of the younger generation.","Feng Wu asked, “Is that so?”","Feng Xun said excitedly, “There are eight places in total. The ones from the Sky Group are Ye Yijian, the sacred son of the Formless Sword Sect, and Wuyu, the monk.","“The ones from the Earth Group are Fairy Ziyun of the Red Feather Room and Qiu Zhennan of the Mountain Sea Academy.”","Feng Wu was surprised. “Fairy Ziyun? Hasn’t she left the Red Feather Room already?”","Feng Xun nodded. “So, she’s not representing the Red Feather Room. She represents the Dayan Empire.”","Feng Wu nodded. That explained it.","“Yan Yu and Yu Mingye are in from the Black Group.”","Feng Wu frowned again. “He’s already in the top eight?”","If she remembered correctly, Prince Yan Yu wasn’t much better than Luo Zilin before, but he was able to make it into the top eight this time.","“Yes, he’s in the top eight.","“You’ve heard about the Yellow Group. It’s you and Luo Zizhong.” Feng Xun grinned at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was confused. “So, how are we going to proceed? Are we still going to draw lots?”","Luo Zilin nodded and said, “According to the competition, the four top students will draw lots, but it’ll be different this time. Only the four of you will draw..”"]},{"number":4223,"title":"Chapter 4223: Eight to Four","paragraphs":["Chapter 4223: Eight to Four","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu was confused. “How so?”","Luo Zilin said, “There are four cards in total, two in red and two in blue.” “Red card against red, and blue card against the blue...”","Feng Wu was still trying to figure it out when someone called her name.","Luo Zilin nudged Feng Wu. ‘Go ahead. Show me the cards first, and I’ll explain the rules. Otherwise, someone else will take all the good ones.”","Three people were already on the stage, and they were the top students of the Sky, Earth, and Black Groups.","They were Wuyu of the Primordial Pagoda, Qiu Zhennan of the Mountain Sea Academy, and Yan Yu, the son of Lord Yan. Feng Wu was the only one missing.","Hence, Feng Wu casually walked up to them and stood at the end.","Yan Yu gave Feng Wu a contemptuous look and smirked. “I didn’t know you were here.”","That was a very sarcastic thing to say.","Feng Wu snorted. “I didn’t know you could be such a pervert.”","Yan Yu’s face was livid as he stared at Feng Wu. “What did you say?!”","Crossing her hands behind her back, Feng Wu stood there with her legs spread out. Hearing that, she glanced at Yan Yu. “Can’t you hear me? Do you need me to raise my voice?”","Yan Yu was so angry that he laughed. After a while, he said, “I really hope you’ll be my opponent.”","Feng Wu said, “I’ll defeat you.”","Yan Yu snorted and didn’t want to talk to Feng Wu anymore.","Qiu Zhennan stood there, unperturbed, with a brooding look in his eyes.","Wuyu glanced at Feng Wu and frowned.","Soon, Wuyu went up to draw the lots.","He drew a red card.","It was Qiu Zhennan’s turn next, and he drew a blue card.","That was to say, Wuyu’s team wouldn’t run into Qiu Zhennan’s team in the quarterfinals.","Yan Yu was the third to roll the dice, and he drew a blue card.","That way, Feng Wu wouldn’t have to draw anymore, for there was only one red card left.","Wuyu cast a stern look at Feng Wu and said, “I hope you can win this competition. Only then will you have a chance to meet me on the battlefield.”","Feng Wu nodded. “You should hope that you won’t run into me.”","Wuyu smirked and stopped talking.","The Sky Group vs the Yellow Group.","The Earth Group vs the Black Group.","Moreover, the top student of each group was fighting the second best of their opponents.","That was to say, Wuyu was fighting Luo Zizhong.","Feng Wu would fight Ye Yijian.","Qiu Zhennan vs Yu Mingye.","Yan Yu was fighting Fairy Ziyun.","Everyone had different expressions on their faces as soon as they saw the schedule.","On Feng Wu’s side, Luo Zilin blanched. Grabbing Feng Xun, he said nervously,","“We’re so unlucky this time. I have a bad feeling about this!”","Feng Xun nodded and said, “Ye Yijian... I heard that he was very capable.”","“Of course! Xuan Yi is from the Formless Sword Sect, isn’t he? He knows that better than anyone else!” Luo Zilin took a deep breath and was going to tell Feng Xun about it, but he stopped when he noticed the pricked-up ears.","Xuan Yi said the same.","Just then, Ye Yijian and the others walked toward Feng Wu.","Ye Yijian was followed by a group of people. Feng Wu saw that Prince Yan Yu and Fairy Ziyun were among them.."]},{"number":4224,"title":"Chapter 4224: Eight to Four (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4224: Eight to Four (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“I’ve underestimated you.” Yan Yu stared at Feng Wu with a cold look in his eyes.","Feng Wu gave her a half-smile. “Likewise.”","Yan Yu said, “If I had known that you would end up like this, I would have...”","Feng Wu asked, “Is that so?”","Yan Yu snorted. “You wouldn’t still be alive.”","Feng Wu said, “But I’m still alive.”","Yan Yu said, “That’s only because I let you.”","Feng Xun couldn’t take it anymore and was going to argue with the crown prince when Feng Wu stopped him. “Feng Xun, have you heard of this saying?","Feng Xun asked, “What?”","Feng Wu glanced at him and said casually, “Do you know how villains usually","Feng Xun asked, “How?”","He wasn’t the only one. Many people pricked up their ears as well. After all, it was very rare to see people tearing at each other in public like this.","“Villains die from talking too much.”","Feng Wu darted a look at Yan Yu and the others, then left with Feng Xun. The others were furious when they realized what had happened.","“What did she mean by ‘a villain dies from talking too much’? What’s that supposed to mean? Is she calling Prince Yan Yu a villain?”","“Not only did she call Prince Yan Yu a villain, she said he was going to die.”","“Feng Wu is so mean!”","“The weaker ones are the sharper-tongued ones!”","“My lord, I wouldn’t stand it if I were you! ”","The others were all trying to ignite the fire. As a proud man, Yan Yu’s face went scarlet red.","Holding his sword, he was so angry that he laughed. “What a pity. I won’t get to fight her in this round!”","Wuyu nodded and said, “Too bad that she’s going to fight the second best student. If she’s fighting the first, I can help you defeat her and make her wish she was dead!”","“Ye Yijian.” Yan Yu turned to him. “You’re the only one who can give me that chance!”","Ye Yijian frowned. “Your Royal Highness, what do you mean? If you want me to defeat her...”","“No, you’d better not defeat her. Leave it to me!”","He left after that.","Ye Yijian frowned.","Fairy Ziyun smiled at Ye Yijian. “His Royal Highness is helping you.”","Help?","Ye Yijian didn’t understand.","Ziyun whispered something in his ear befOre she left.","The news soon reached the Luo family.","“What’s that supposed to mean? Is he asking Ye Yijian to give in? If you win, they’ll say that Ye Yijian gave in on purpose!” Feng Xun couldn’t sit still anymore.","“If Xiao Wu loses, Ye Yijian won’t let Xiao Wu go. If Xiao Wu wins, they’ll say that Ye Yijian went easy on Xiao Wu. The competition hasn’t even started yet, but they’re already talking!”","“Xuan Yi, aren’t you from the Formless Sword Sect? What kind of a person is Ye Yijian? Is he a bad person?” Feng Xun and Luo Zilin asked anxiously.","Xuan Yi smiled bitterly. “The Formless Sword Sect is divided into two factions. One is on my master’s side, and the other is on my senior uncle’s side. Ye Yijian is my senior uncle’s son and his only successor.”","“Then your snior uncle...”","Xuan Yi shook his head. “My master is on the Luo family’s side, but my senior uncle isn’t on our side.”","“In other words, Ye Yijian isn’t on the same side as us?”"]},{"number":4225,"title":"Chapter 4225: Eight to Four (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4225: Eight to Four (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Did he pick on you?” Seeing that Xuan Yi wanted to say something but hesitated, Feng Wu couldn’t help but ask.","Immediately, all eyes were on Xuan Yi.","Xuan Yi remained unperturbed. “It wasn’t bullying.”","“He must have! Otherwise, you wouldn’t have never mentioned the Formless Sword Sect!” Feng Xun reacted quickly. Grabbing Xuan Yi, he said, “Tell me. What did they do to you?”","Xuan Yi shook his head. “It wasn’t much. Ye Yijian challenged me.” Feng Xun asked, “Challenged you? When?!”","Xuan Yi said, “When I arrived at the Formless Sword Sect.”","“Damn it!” Feng Xun clenched his fists in frustration. “You weren’t fully capable back then, and he was so much more capable than you. Challenging you? That was pure bullying!”","“Isn’t she like my former senior sister?” Chaoge said grumpily. “She tried to challenge me as well, but Xiao Wu defeated her.”","“The most important thing now is the competition.” Luo Zizhong, who had kept his silence, cut them off. “Xiao Wu is fighting Ye Yijian, who should be about the same level as Brother Ziji. If Xiao Wu can defeat my brother, she should be able to defeat Ye Yijian.”","Feng Wu and Luo Ziji exchanged looks, and then started a competition.","“Brother Zizhong, your opponent is Wuyu, you...” Luo Zilin said worriedly.","Luo Zizhong smiled bitterly. “Wuyu is the sacred son of the Buddhist sect, and he’s said to be a genius. I don’t have any confidence in defeating him, not to mention that the Buddhist sect has been very close to the Dayan Empire over the years. I’m afraid that they still have some secret tricks up their sleeves.” The first round of the quarterfinals was between the crown prince and Fairy","Ziyun.","Needless to say, Fairy Ziyun had become Yan Yu’s stepping stone.","The second round was between Qiu Zhennan and Yu Mingye.","To everyone’s surprise...","“Qiu Zhennan has lost? What’s going on?”","‘Qiu Zhennan is the leader of the younger generation of the Mountain Sea Academy. How could he lose to Yu Mingye?”","Feng Wu was also watching the competition and she frowned when she saw Yu Mingye defeat Qiu Zhennan... It shouldn’t be like this.","However, when Feng Wu took another look at Qiu Zhennan, she realized that something was wrong with him.","“Qiu Zhennan is injured,” Feng Wu whispered to the others. “His soul is injured, and it’s new. If I’m guessing right, it happened last night.”","“Last night?” Feng Xun cried out in surprise. “He was injured last night when his competition was today? Wouldn’t that give Yu Mingye an advantage? That’s a bit... strange.”","Feng Wu nodded. “That’s right.”","Just then, Yu Mingye ran happily to Feng Xun and the others.","“Feng Xun, did you see that? I’m in the top four now!” Yu Mingye gloated.","Resting his hands on his waist, Feng Xun darted a glance at Yu Mingye without saying a word.","Yu Mingye nudged him with his elbow. “What? Are you jealous of me?”","Feng Xun said, “I won’t take advantage of my injured opponent!”","Yu Mingye froze on the spot. “What do you mean?”","Feng Xun pressed. “Didn’t you come to the Dayan Empire with us? I don’t think you have any connections here. Who did it for you? The crown prince? Did you really join him?”","Just then, the crown prince called Yu Mingye’s name.","All Yu Mingye said in a hurry was, “Just trust me. I’ll never betray my friends!”","After that, he gave Feng Wu a long look before running toward the crown prince.."]},{"number":4226,"title":"Chapter 4226: Eight to Four (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4226: Eight to Four (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“There’s something so strange about him.” Feng Xun couldn’t figure out what was going on with Yu Mingye these days.","“Xiao Wu, what do you think?” Feng Xun asked curiously.","Feng Wu said, “I believe that Yu Mingye is still our Yu Mingye, and that won’t change. But the next round is our top priority now.”","The next round was between Luo Zizhong and Wuyu, the sacred son of Buddhism.","The competition was divided into three fractions.","The eldest prince was the head of the dynasty, Feng Wu was the head of the Luo family, and Qiu Zhennan was the head of the neutral group.","Feng Wu knew that Luo Zizhong was going to lose the third round, but she didn’t expect Wuyu to be so powerful.","Luo Zizhong was defeated after three strikes.","“How’s that possible?” Luo Zilin grabbed Feng Wu’s hand in astonishment. “My brother was defeated after three strikes? That’s impossible!”","Feng Wu’s eyes were as cold as frost. “Wuyu is very, very powerful. He’s even more powerful than I expected.”","Feng Wu kept her gaze on Wuyu as she spoke, not daring to let her guard down.","Luo Zilin kept his gaze on the arena as well.","All of a sudden, his face darkened.","“My brother is ready to give in, and he’s raised his hand, but Wuyu is still attacking!” Luo Zilin clenched his fists. “What’s he doing?!”","Luo Zilin wasn’t the only one. Everyone saw with their own eyes that Wuyu was attacking in a frenzy while Luo Zizhong was losing ground.","“I... give...”","Wuyu didn’t give Luo Zizhong any chance to finish his sentence.","“Damn it!”","Luo Zilin was furious.","Feng Wu glared at Wuyu with bloodshot eyes.","“Luo Zizhong has lost. I give in on his behalf. Stop!” Feng Wu jumped onto the stage.","However, before she could steady herself, a figure jumped out and blocked Feng Wu’s way. It was none other than Yan Yu, the crown prince.","“Don’t. This is someone else’s arena. Just watch and don’t interfere.” Holding a fan, Yan Yu smiled at Feng Wu, but the smile didn’t reach his eyes.","The referees included the Princess Royal, the crown prince, and Lord Yan. Luo Nantian was one of them.","“Uncle!” Feng Wu cried out.","Luo Nantian struck out right away.","Princess Royal struck out at the same time.","“Stop,” said an indifferent voice. It was none other than the abbot of the Primordial Pagoda.","Only then did Wuyu stop.","“Brother!” Feng Wu rushed in, steadied Luo Zizhong, and stuffed a pill into his mouth.","Luo Zizhong was covered with cuts and bruises and didn’t look too well. If Feng Wu hadn’t intervened in time, he would have suffered from side effects even if he was saved.","“Wuyu.” Feng Wu turned around and stared at the monk.","“Amitabha.” Wuyu remained unperturbed as if he wasn’t the one who had done this.","“I’ll make you pay for what you did to my brother today,” Feng Wu said calmly.","“I’ll wait.” After that, Wuyu turned to leave the stage.","Feng Wu and Luo Zilin helped Luo Zizhong off the stage. Immediately, everyone gathered around and expressed their concern.","“The fourth round starts now! Fighters of both teams, please enter the arena!” It was a battle between Feng Wu and Ye Yijian of the Formless Sword Sect.","“Ye Yijian, if you lose, I’ll despise you.” Fairy Ziyun glanced at Ye Yijian. Ye Yijian snorted.. “If I can’t even defeat a girl, I’ll never be the best swordsman of the future!”"]},{"number":4227,"title":"Chapter 4227: Eight to Four (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4227: Eight to Four (5)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Feng Wu, you’re so going to lose!”","When the two of them were on the stage, Fairy Ziyun cupped her hands around her mouth and shouted at Feng Wu, “You’re facing the future top swordsman!”","“Really?” Feng Wu smiled at Ye Yijian. “Why can’t I tell?”","Ye Yijian said, “You’re going to lose this battle.”","Feng Wu said, “Young man, don’t be so arrogant. What if you’re the one who loses?”","Ye Yijian said, “If I lose, you can have Yuchang, my sword. I’ll never use it again! ”","Yuchang was one of the ten famous swords, and it was hard to come by.","Feng Wu said, “Alright. What if I lose?” Ye Yijian smirked. “You’ll soon find out.”","After that, Ye Yijian struck out.","A streak of light flew toward Feng Wu like a shooting star!","It was so fast!","Feng Wu took a step back and made a Taiji gesture with her hands. The space within three meters from her contorted, as if an invisible power was gathering around her.","The next second, Ye Yi was ten feet away from Feng Wu.","That was unbelievable speed!","“Xiao Wu, watch out!”","Luo Zilin broke into a cold sweat and couldn’t help but cry out.","He had to keep an eye on the stage while taking care of Luo Zizhong.","Ye Yijian thought he had succeeded with one strike.","He wasn’t the only one. The Princess Royal was smiling as well.","Even Ye Yijian didn’t know that his sword...","But the princess would never tell anyone about it.","Thump!","The next second, Ye Yijian flew backward.","He used the momentum to flip around in mid-air and charged at Feng Wu again!","The fierce sword intent filled the air.","Instead of dodging, Feng Wu charged at him.","Clang!","Their swords clashed in the air, creating a series of sparks. Ye Yijian was about to draw out his sword when there was a whooshing sound. Feng Wu had already caught his sword. The next second!","Pffft!","There was the sound of tearing muscles.","Feng Wu struck down with her sword. It cut Ye Yijian open from his face to his belly.","“Ye Yijian!”","“How’s that possible?!”","“Why is she...”","Shocked, Princess Royal rose to her feet and stared at what was going on.","The others rose to their feet as well.","It had never occurred to them that Feng Wu would win.","Not only did Feng Wu win, but she had also defeated Ye Yijian in less than two strikes.","However, Ye Yijian’s sword...","The face of the head of the Formless Sword Sect was livid.","Feng Wu said, “Good game.”","Ye Yijian threw a dirty look at Feng Wu and almost passed out. At that moment, someone from the Formless Sword Sect caught him.","“Senior Brother!” Ye Erjian cried out.","“Let’s go!” Ye Yijian gritted his teeth and was ready to leave the stage.","Just then, Feng Wu raised her eyebrows. “Wait.” Immediately, all eyes were on Feng Wu.","‘What?!” Ye Yijian glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu smiled at Ye Yijian’s sword.","Ye Yijian suddenly remembered what he said before the competition, and he was furious.","He had overestimated himself.","He had bragged before the competition that he was going to defeat Feng Wu. If he lost, he would give her the sword.","Yuchang Sword...","It wasn’t just a famous sword, but it contained his sword energy as well.","Without it, the power of his sword intent would be greatly reduced, which was why Ye Yijian didn’t want to part with it.."]},{"number":4228,"title":"Chapter 4228: Eight to Four (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4228: Eight to Four (6)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","However, Feng Wu reached out without hesitation.","It was so obvious.","Ye Yijian gritted his teeth and glared at Feng Wu. Seeing how nonchalant she was, he had no choice but to smash the sword into Feng Wu’s hands. “Let’s go!” Having been humiliated, Ye Yijian wanted to leave.","However, Feng Wu stopped him. “Wait.”","Ye Yijian glared at Feng Wu. “I’ve given you the sword. What more do you want?!”","Feng Wu gave him a half-smile. “How long do you think you have?”","The others couldn’t stand it anymore, let alone Ye Yijian. They all glared at Feng Wu. “He has lost, and he has given you the sword. What more do you want? It’s his life!”","Feng Wu ignored the others and only stared at Ye Yijian. “If you leave like this, you’ll really be dead.”","Ye Yijian suddenly realized something. ‘What do you mean?”","Feng Wu said, “Haven’t I made myself clear enough?”","Ye Yijian said, “How can I be dead? The wound isn’t deep!”","The look on the Princess Royal’s face was very grim.","Why did this Feng Wu keep ruining her plans?!","Earlier, she had ordered someone to put poison on Ye Yijian’s sword so that he could kill Feng Wu with it. Even if he couldn’t kill Feng Wu, he would at least poison her so that the Formless Sword Sect and the Luo family would fight to","the death. But now...","Had Feng Wu figured it out? No, that shouldn’t be the case. The poison she used was colorless and odorless. How could Feng Wu...","“Haven’t you realized that you’ve been poisoned?” Feng Wu looked at him in resignation. “And you call yourself the best swordsman of the future? Is that all you can do?”","Feng Wu’s words were so harsh that Ye Yijian was furious. However, his spiritual essence reacted to him first and he began to examine his spiritual","essence.","“Wait a minute!”","“Senior Brother, what’s wrong?” Ye Erjian helped his senior brother to his feet.","The other members of the Formless Sword Sect were around as well. Even Ye Buqi, the Wild Sword of the Formless Sword Sect, rose to his feet and walked up the stage.","“She’s right. I’ve been poisoned,” Ye Yijian took a deep breath and said slowly.","Poisoned?!","Everyone stared at Ye Yijian in disbelief.","Ye Erjian was the first to react. “Poisoned? Could it be...” He stared at Feng Wu.","He acted as if Feng Wu was the one who had poisoned him.","By then, Feng Xun and the others had run up to them and retorted, “What’s that look in your eyes? If Xiao Wu was the culprit, she could have just killed Ye Yijian. Why did she say it out loud?”","“Maybe she has a guilty conscience.”","“Or could she have done it on purpose so that she wouldn’t be suspected?”","The members of the Formless Sword Sect wouldn’t let her off the hook and started questioning her.","Feng Wu gave Ye Yijian a half-smile.","By then, Ye Yijian had regained his composure.","“It wasn’t her,” Ye Yijian gritted his teeth.","“But Senior Brother...","“You’re right. If she really wanted to kill me, she wouldn’t have told me that. She doesn’t have that motive, not to mention.. Ye Yijian gritted his teeth and said after a while, “The poison was on Yuchang!”","Everybody knew that the sword belonged to Ye Yijian.","The others agreed with him.","“Who’s that?” Ye Erjian asked.","Feng Wu nodded. “That’s a good question.. Who did it?”"]},{"number":4229,"title":"Chapter 4229: Eight to Four (7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4229: Eight to Four (7)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu looked around at the audience as she spoke.","In the end, she looked at the Princess Royal and smiled.","The Princess Royal was speechless.","She was furious, but she had to fight back her anger.","Ye Yijian followed Feng Wu’s voice and was surprised to see the Princess Royal.","Could it be the Princess Royal?","“That’s all I’m going to say. As for who poisoned him, it’s up to your Formless Sword Sect to find out.” Feng Wu waved her hand and left, leaving the others behind.","The Luo family.","“Xiao Wu, who do you think poisoned her?”","The younger generation of the Luo family gathered around and tried to figure out who had done it.","Feng Wu only smiled. “It’s actually very simple.”","“Why do you say that?”","“This person is probably the one who wants me dead the most.”","“The Princess Royal?!” Feng Xun was the first to react. “So, it was her?!”","Feng Wu nodded. “The toxin will travel through my meridians at first. If I’m dead, as long as she takes the body away in time, my internal organs won’t be poisoned by then. Even if they are, she’ll have a way to neutralize the toxin.” “So, it’s still for her sickly daughter!” Feng Xun clenched his fists in rage.","Feng Wu shrugged. “My mother and Xiaoqi’s existence infuriated her all the time, so of course she has to get rid of me.”","Once Feng Wu was dead, the beautiful lady and Xiaoqi would be in a lot of danger as well.","“Xiao Wu...” Feng Xun was concerned.","Feng Wu said, “Don’t worry. If she wants me dead, I won’t let her live either!”","Just then, Luo Ziji walked in.","“Here’s your letter.” Luo Ziji came back with a letter for Feng Wu.","“Who brought it?” Feng Wu took the letter and looked confused.","Luo Ziji shook his head. “It’s from a beggar on the street. I don’t think it’ll be easy to find the messenger.”","“Is it poisonous?” That was Feng Xun’s first reaction.","Feng Wu shook her head. “I could tell right away that Ye Yijian was poisoned, and so many people here knew about it. I’m sure they all know that I’m a good doctor, so of course they wouldn’t make such a stupid mistake.”","After that, Feng Wu looked down at the letter.","The handwriting was so powerful that Feng Wu was a little taken aback.","“Xiao Wii?”","“Are you really poisoned?!”","“What’s wrong with this letter?!”","Feng Wu ignored them and stuffed the letter into her chest pocket. “Shouldn’t you be busy? I need to get back to my cultivation. The semifinals are in three days!”","Feng Wu ran off after that. “Well...","“Why do I feel that...”","“Something doesn’t feel right.”","“I think so, too. Who wrote that letter?!”","“Why do I feel that her eyes are lit up?!”","While the others were guessing, Feng Wu had hidden in her room and closed the door behind her. She leaned against it and let out a breath of relief.","Feng Wu recognized the handwriting on the envelope.","It was his handwriting, right?","It should be his, right?","Feng Wu didn’t think much of it before, but after half a year, she realized that the person was becoming more and more familiar. Feng Wu, stop running away. You miss him.","Feng Wu blushed and opened the letter.","There were only a few words in the letter.","Feng Wu’s cheeks flushed when she saw those words.."]},{"number":4230,"title":"Chapter 4230: The Twelve Trials of Love","paragraphs":["Chapter 4230: The Twelve Trials of Love","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","This shouldn’t have happened.","Why did he suddenly say that?","Feng Wu looked back and forth at the handwriting. It had to be Jun Linyuan, right?","But why was he suddenly so enthusiastic and unrestrained?","Or was someone mimicking him to make fun of her?","There was a knock at the door.","Feng Wu was still lost in her daydreaming when she was woken up by the Imock on the door. “Who’s there?”","“Xiao Wu, it’s me.”","There was a knock on the door.","It was Feng Xun.","Feng Wu opened the door and looked at him in resignation. “What now?”","Feng Xun looked Feng Wu up and down. “What’s wrong?”","He looked confused. “Why do I feel that there’s something wrong with you?”","Feng Wu asked, “What’s wrong?”","Feng Xun said, “Why are your ears so red? And your eyes are so shiny. They’re much brighter than usual. I can tell that Boss Jun is the one who sent that letter.” What was that?","“It’s that obvious!”","Feng Xun seemed to know how frustrated Feng Wu was and he chuckled. “It’s so obvious. It really is Boss Jun, isn’t it? Show me. What did Boss Jun write?” Of course, Feng Wu wouldn’t let him see that. She sent Feng Xun away right away.","After sending Feng Xun away, Feng Wu stared at the words in a trance-like state.","“I love you.”","Apart from that, there was no signature. Feng Wu wasn’t sure if Jun Linyuan had written it or not.","Moreover, even if Jun Linyuan had written it, why would he confess his love for no reason? Even if he wanted to confess, couldn’t he do it in person? Why did he have to send the letter?","Was he sincere or not?","Feng Wu’s head was spinning when she heard Little Phoenix’s voice in her head.","“Ahhh!!! It’s done! It’s done! Trial Twelve is done!!!” Feng Wu heard a loud voice in her head, which she recognized.","It was the fairy.","“Xiao Wu, look! Come in!” Little Phoenix couldn’t control its excitement.","Feng Wu went into the ring to have a look.","As soon as she walked in, the fairy jumped around with a broken star piece in her hands and charged at Feng Wu.","“Look! Look!” The fairy was so excited that her cheeks were flushed.","“The second broken star piece?” Feng Wu was thrilled, but because of that, her voice was very low.","She feared that if she raised her voice a little, she would ruin the pleasant surprise and realize that it was only a dream.","“This isn’t a dream! It’s real! You’ve got the second broken star piece! It’s right here!” The fairy presented it with both hands.","Holding the shiny broken star piece in her hand, Feng Wu studied it attentively. It took her a while to come back to herself. “Why is it suddenly...”","“Because you’ve completed the last trial of the 12 Trials of Love.” Little Phoenix grinned at Feng Wu.","It had been a while since the 12 Trials of Love, but Feng Wu had been stuck in","the 12th trial because the mission was to become a couple with Jun Linyuan.","Feng Wu said, “But we didn’t...’","She had just received Jun Linyuan’s message.","“You’ve been flirting with each other for so long, and now that he said those words, it’s a done deal! The 12 Trials of Love are finally over!”"]},{"number":4231,"title":"Chapter 4231: Dragon Hall","paragraphs":["Chapter 4231: Dragon Hall","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu asked, “Are you sure?”","The fairy said, “Of course! You know what Jun Linyuan is like. It’ll be impossible for him to say those words. How else are you going to make sure that you’re in a relationship?”","Feng Wu said, “I... I didn’t say yes.”","The fairy said, “But you didn’t say no.”","Feng Wu hesitated. “But...”","The fairy said casually, “Do you want the broken star piece or not?”","Feng Wu said, “Of course!”","The fairy said, “It’s a yes, then.”","Feng Wu was speechless.","No matter what, she had to get the broken star piece first!","She already had two broken star pieces. The third one was in her third senior brother’s hands, and she should be able to get it once she found him. The fourth piece would be obtained from the last battle of the Dragon Gate Banquet.","She would be rewarded with the broken star piece if she became the winner.","Her master would wake up when all four broken star pieces were collected. Feng Wu couldn’t help but smile at that thought.","But... Why did Jun Linyuan suddenly send her those words? What was going on over there?","Dayan Empire, the imperial palace.","It was Dragon Hall, the most respected and mysterious hall in the imperial palace.","A thin, energetic old man sat on a rock, and a handsome teenager stood in front of him.","If Feng Wu were here, she would recognize the person right away. It was none other than Jun Linyuan himself.","There was a guard outside the Dragon Hall, and no one dared to look in their direction.","It was none other than Feng, the steward.","Why would Feng, the steward who had been following Jun Linyuan around, show up in the imperial palace of the Dayan Empire in broad daylight, let alone in the most mysterious and respected palace in the imperial capital?","The old man was the emperor’s father, the most influential figure in the palace, and he was the real ruler of the empire.","The emperor of the Dayan Empire only controlled the empire on the surface.","Of course, only a handful of people knew about it.","Meanwhile, the most respected and capable man of the Dayan Empire glanced at Jun Linyuan with a smile. “Did you tell her your true feelings?”","Jun Linyuan only glanced at him and didn’t answer.","“Which girl did you give it to? Do you need me to propose a marriage for you?” The man was usually too serious to speak, but his attitude toward Jun Linyuan was quite conciliatory.","Jun Linyuan took a deep breath. “It’s none of your business!”","The old man chuckled. “If I hadn’t forced you, how long do you think you could have kept her a secret?”","Jun Linyuan smirked. “It’s none of your business.”","The Emperor Emeritus thought, “Why wouldn’t I have anything to do with it? If you hadn’t flown in and out of the palace walls every night, I would never have known you’d been spying on her every night!”","It wouldn’t be so surprising if she was just an ordinary girl, but she had the Divine Phoenix Blood!","“Why are you still stalling when you see the Divine Phoenix Blood? Marry her as soon as possible!”","Therefore, Emperor Emeritus deliberately provoked Jun Linyuan to compete with him. As a result, Jun Linyuan lost, which was why he sent the letter.","The Emperor Emeritus rose to his feet and put his hands behind his back. “Don’t blame me for tricking you. That girl is so hard to come by. Don’t let other people take her away.”","Jun Linyuan said grumpily, “I won’t!”","The Emperor Emeritus chuckled. “Fine, as long as you know what you’re doing.","I just want to help that girl so that she can become the winner..”"]},{"number":4232,"title":"Chapter 4232: Semifinal (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4232: Semifinal (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“It’s not time to see her yet,” Jun Linyuan said quietly after the Emperor Emeritus left.","“Master.” Before he knew it, Feng the steward had walked up to Jun Linyuan.","Jun Linyuan handed him a jade pendant. ‘Give it to Xiao Wu and tell her that no matter what happens, I’ll keep her safe.”","“Your Royal Highness, aren’t you going to...” Feng suggested.","“You know how I am now. If someone finds out about it, it’ll bring her danger. Apart from my grandfather, who already knows about it, I dont want anyone else to know about it!”","Feng the steward said, “Yes!”","Feng took the jade pendant to Feng Wu and told her about the letter Jun Linyuan had sent her. He didn’t want Feng Wu to think that it was from someone else.","Feng Wu said, “I know it’s him.” The 12 Trials of Love was indirect proof.","“This is the Spiritual Formula, an ultimate cultivation technique of the royal family of the Dayan Empire. Even if you can’t master it in a while, once you’re familiar with it, it won’t be difficult for you to handle the people of the empire.”","“If that’s the case, how did Jun Linyuan get his hands on it? How’s he doing? Is he in danger? Why didn’t he come to me himself?”","Feng Wu had so many questions, but the steward only smiled bitterly. “Miss","Wu will know everything when the time is right.”","Somehow, Feng Wu felt that Jun Linyuan was hiding a big secret.","“Miss Wu, isn’t the Dragon Gate Banquet your top priority now? It’s better for you to focus on it.” As for the secret of the royal family, His Royal Highness would tell her himself when he was free.","After the steward left, Feng Wu had no choice but to put Jun Linyuan’s matter aside and focus on her cultivation.","The semifinal would start in three days.","This time, it was a last-minute draw.","Feng Wu picked Wuyu, while Yu Mingye would fight Yan Yu.","The first battle was between Yu Mingye and Yan Yu. As expected, Yu Mingye lost.","The second round.","In the arena, Wuyu looked at Feng Wu and smirked. “It’s finally your turn.”","Feng Wu said, “You won’t go any further.”","Wuyu snickered. “Yan Yu is right. What an arrogant and stubborn girl. For the sake of the Luo family, I’ll allow you to surrender now, but on your knees!”","Feng Wu said, “For the sake of the Primordial Pagoda, I’ll allow you to surrender now, but on your knees!”","“Good, Feng Wu. If you don’t admit your defeat now, you’ll never have a chance!”","Wuyu struck out before he could finish his sentence.","No one knew how he did it, but he moved so fast that no one had time to react.","Feng Wu had to admit that Wuyu was the most powerful opponent in this Dragon Gate Banquet, so powerful that she had to be serious.","However, Feng Wu had been making breakthroughs very fast. She was already a Level-8 Spiritual Sovereign, and Wuyu was only a Level-7 Spiritual Sovereign at most. He was no match for Feng Wu.","“You!”","Only then did Wuyu realize how terrifying Feng Wu was.","“How are you...”","Feng Wu didn’t pretend to be defeated, nor did she show any weakness. Instead, she exerted all her power as a Level-8 Spiritual Sovereign.","As a result, Wuyu kept losing ground.","“How’s that possible?”","“Level 8? She’s so young, but she’s already at Level 8!”"]},{"number":4233,"title":"Chapter 4233: Semifinal (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4233: Semifinal (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“She’s so young, but she’s already a Level-8 Spiritual Sovereign! That’s so scary! ”","A Level-8 Spiritual Sovereign was already one of the top cultivators on this continent.","It was almost impossible for the younger generation to reach that level, and only a handful of middle-aged people had risen that high.","“Xiao Wu...” Even Luo Nantian was surprised. Feng Wu was only a Level- 6 Spiritual Sovereign when the incident took place in the blood pool, but she was a Level-8 one now. What did she do?","Everyone was astonished. Expectedly, Wuyu fell to the ground after Feng Wu hit him, and Feng Wu stepped on his back.","His face hit the ground first, and Wuyu raised his head to stare at Feng Wu.","Blood was oozing out of the corner of his mouth, and he was covered in wounds. He looked intimidating.","But Feng Wu wasn’t intimidated. She smiled calmly and asked, ‘What? Are you not going to surrender?”","“I won’t accept it!”","As soon as Wuyu shouted, Feng Wu whipped him.","Poor Wuyu. Feng Wu had stepped on his back, and he couldn’t even turn around, let alone stand up. He had no choice but to endure the whipping.","Feng Wu’s whip had been soaked with salt water, and the salt seeped into the wound. Wuyu drew in his breath in pain.","“I won’t accept it!”","There was the sound of a whip.","“I won’t accept it!”","There was the sound of a whip.","Each whip dealt a lot of damage, and he was severely injured.","Wuyu didn’t want to admit his defeat at first, but then, he was barely breathing. However, Feng Wu still wanted to hit him. He couldn’t care less about his dignity anymore and gave in right away.","He wanted to give in, but Feng Wu wouldn’t let him.","Before, Luo Zizhong wanted to give in, but Wuyu didn’t give him any chance.","Of course, Feng Wu wouldn’t give him that chance.","“Stop! He has given in!”","The abbot of the Primordial Pagoda shouted angrily.","“He didn’t admit his defeat himself. How do you know that? He’s so stubborn.” Feng Wu cracked her whip again.","Poor Wuyu. He spat out another mouthful of blood.","While Feng Wu was talking to the abbot of the Primordial Pagoda, Wuyu used all his strength to shout, “I give in!”","“Hmph, that was quick.” Feng Wu glanced at Wuyu. “One more time, and I’ll kill you!”","Wuyu was speechless.","He was the arrogant one before, but now, Feng Wu was the one...","However, he couldn’t say anything and had to leave the stage.","However, when he reached the last step, he suddenly turned around and stared at Feng Wu with a grim look on his face.","“Prince Yan Yu is next. He’s going to win! I’ve lost, but you’ll be more miserable than me in the next round!”","Wuyu only walked off the stage after that.","The next round was between the last two players.","The ultimate battle between Feng Wu and Yan Yu.","Before Feng Wu and Yan Yu got onto the stage, the audience was already talking among themselves.","Feng Wu and Yan Yu represented two forces.","Feng Wu represented the Luo family, and Yan Yu represented the royal family.","Therefore, the competition was between the Luo family and the royal family.","Most people still thought that he could win.","“I think Prince Yan Yu is better. After all, although the Luo family is powerful, the royal family has more resources..”"]},{"number":4234,"title":"Chapter 4234: Final Round","paragraphs":["Chapter 4234: Final Round","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Prince Yan Yu has been famous for many years and has always been an outstanding figure among the younger generation. Feng Wu is still too young.” “But I think Feng Wu is very talented. Maybe something unexpected will","happen.”","“What surprise can he possibly have in the face of absolute power? You have no idea, but I heard that the royal family has been supporting Prince Yan Yu with all their effort. Right now, Prince Yan Yu is terrifyingly capable!”","“I heard about it, too. It was said that the elders of the royal family taught it to","Prince Yan Yu directly!”","“What level is he now?”","“I heard that he’s a peak Level-8 Spiritual Sovereign!”","“Feng Wu is a junior Level-8 one, isn’t she?”","“That’s right. That’s why I said that Prince Yan Yu was going to win!”","Many people were discussing among themselves, and the judges took their seats as well.","The principal of the Mountain Sea Academy sat next to Luo Nantian.","He cupped his hands at Luo Nantian and sighed in amazement. “I saw her with my own eyes on Dynasty Road last year. I thought she was smart and talented, but I didn’t expect her to have grown so much!”","Luo Nantian smiled. “She’s a lucky girl.”","The principal said, “That can’t be summarized by sheer luck. She has risen to","Level 8 in such a short time. She’s almost as good as us.”","Luo Nantian said, “She’s still not as good as we are.”","The principal said, “I heard that Lord Yan’s residence spared no effort and paid an exorbitant price to raise Yan Yu to Level 8. Your girl has to be careful this time.”","While Luo Nantian and the principal were chatting, the others didn’t stay idle either.","The princess and Lord Yan exchanged looks, and there was a tacit understanding in their eyes that only they could understand. In the end, the princess smiled, rose to her feet, and made her speech.","“After a round of fierce competition...” The princess finished her sentence. “In the end, we have two candidates left. They’re Yan Yu and... Feng Wu!","“Let’s have them on the stage.","“So, who’s going to be the winner of this Dragon Gate Banquet?","“Who’s going to get my broken star piece?","“We’ll hand the arena to them!”","After that, the Princess Royal glanced at Feng Wu with a meaningful look in her eyes.","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched. The look gave her a very bad feeling.","What cards did she have up her sleeves?","Something flickered in Feng Wu’s eyes, but before she could do anything, the crown prince stepped out and called her name.","“What? Are you too scared to come up to the stage? If you want to give in now, you can always do it,” Yan Yu said sarcastically.","Feng Xun chimed in without hesitation. “Why would she be scared? Xiao Wu is better than you! You’re the one who’s going to lose!”","Feng Wu’s train of thought was interrupted, and when she tried to recall, she couldn’t. Her instinct told her that it was a very important point!","Seeing the frown on Feng Wu’s face, Feng Xun’s stomach lurched. He asked nervously, “Xiao Wu, what’s wrong?”","Feng Wu shook her head. “I just can’t remember... Once I’m up there, keep an eye on your surroundings. If there’s anything out there, send me a signal!”","Feng Xun and Luo Zilin said in unison, “Sure!”"]},{"number":4235,"title":"Chapter 4235: Final Round (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4235: Final Round (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Up on the stage,","In the end, Prince Yan Yu made the first move.","He charged at Feng Wu like a shooting star, and a murderous energy filled the arena.","The difference between a peak Level-8 Spiritual Sovereign and a junior one was obvious.","Yan Yu kept attacking Feng Wu, and Feng Wu kept falling back.","Thump!","The sharp energy exploded over Feng Wu’s head.","Feng Wu fell back as fast as she could, but she was still affected a little. Her smooth skin flushed.","“Again!”","The crown prince closed in with a cold look in his eyes.","The energy charged at Feng Wu like a dragon!","Even the sky had changed color, let alone around the arena!","Feng Wu turned and ran away.","Yan Yu ran after Feng Wu.","“Where do you think you’re going?!”","He picked up his sword and ran after Feng Wu.","Feng Xun clenched his fists.","Luo Zilin stared at the arena with a solemn look on his face.","Naturally, many people on Yan Yu’s side were pleased. They looked at Feng Wu, who was running away, in a condescending manner.","In the referees’ seat, the Princess Royal smiled as well. She glanced at Luo Nantian and said, “I think we’ll soon see who’s going to win.”","Luo Nantian snorted but didn’t reply.","However, the abbot only smiled and said, “That’s right. Prince Yan Yu is indeed a capable cultivator. You’re indeed one of the best of your generation.","Congratulations, Lord Yan.”","Lord Yan waved his hand. “Master Yuanshi, you flatter me. That kid isn’t his match at all. If his opponent was stronger, he wouldn’t have gained the upper hand so easily.”","Luo Nantian’s face was livid. He glanced at Lord Yan and smirked. “Lord Yan, do you think you’re going to win?","Lord Yan smiled at Luo Nantian, then turned to the stage and said indifferently, “Master Luo Nantian, don’t you have eyes in your sockets? Can’t you see?”","Luo Nantian snorted.","Lord Yan went on. “Master Luo Nantian, don’t forget our bet. You can’t afford to lose.”","Was there a bet between the two forces?","The audience pricked up their ears, hoping to hear more about the gossip, but the ambiguous conversation between Lord Yan and the Luo Nantian made it impossible for them to guess.","Luo Nantian said, “Don’t worry. I’ll keep my word. I’m just afraid that Lord Yan won’t be able to take the defeat.”","“Hahahaha —","Lord Yan guffawed. “Yu is about to win. Why should I be a sore loser? That’s just preposterous! ”","In order to improve Yan Yu’s capability, the royal family used two elders, who were as capable as Lord Yan. That was how much the royal family had paid for","Yan Yu to win.","However, the situation suddenly changed when Lord Yan guffawed.","Lord Yan’s smile was so twisted that he froze on the spot.","On the stage, Feng Wu had been chased by Yan Yu, but she suddenly stopped.","Thump!","There was a series of explosions behind her.","Flames filled the air and thick smoke rose up, wrapping around Yan Yu.","Feng Wu stood outside the fire and kept throwing more spells into it.","Feng Wu was a multi-elemental cultivator to begin with, and she had exerted all her power!"]},{"number":4236,"title":"Chapter 4236: Final Round (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4236: Final Round (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Both of them were Level-8 Spiritual Sovereigns. The only difference was that one was a junior and the other a peak one.","Therefore, Feng Wu’s attack was still lethal to Yan Yu.","Whoosh!","A corner of his defense was finally breached.","Ordinary people might not understand it, but the referees were all capable cultivators of the continent.","Both the abbot and Lord Yan stiffened.","Feng Wu had sharp eyes. Sensing the crack in Yan Yu’s defense, she exerted even more power.","Soon, cuts appeared on Yan Yu’s face.","“Yan Yu!!!”","Lord Yan rose to his feet and bellowed at the crown prince.","They didn’t pay that high price to make him lose.","Yan Yu finally came back to himself. He walked out of the smoke and slowly walked toward Feng Wu.","Right now, he was charred black and had a ferocious look on his face.","He suddenly took a bottle of potion out of his chest pocket, downed it in one go, and tossed it away!","The bottle shattered into pieces, which glinted in the sunlight.","His spiritual essence had been drained before, but now, it was almost overflowing!","“Die!”","Yan Yu, a peak Level-8 Spiritual Sovereign, bellowed in a majestic voice.","“Damn it!”","The look on Luo Nantian’s face was even colder.","He could sense that Yan Yu’s strength had grown rapidly. It was very likely that he was going to make a breakthrough to Level 9.","As expected, the next second, Yan Yu reached Level 9 of the Spiritual Sovereign stage.","Everyone said, “Seriously?!”","“What kind of a genius is he? He made a breakthrough at such a critical moment!”","“Prince Yan Yu is indeed the most capable man of his generation! He made a breakthrough at the critical moment!”","“How is Feng Wu supposed to fight now? She’s already so far behind him, and","the gap is even bigger now.”","“If I were Feng Wu, I would kneel down and beg Prince Yan Yu to spare my life!”","Countless voices came from the audience.","Of course, Feng Wu could see that, but she remained unperturbed and didn’t seem shaken.","The Princess Royal looked confused. How was that possible?","How could Feng Wu be so calm? Shouldn’t she be panic-stricken and at a loss over what to do? Why was she still smiling?","Yes, Feng Wu was smiling like a blossoming peony!","Not only the Princess Royal but the referees and the audience were also intrigued.","Soon, they knew why.","Feng Wu also poured a bottle of potion into her mouth.","The next second, Feng Wu made a breakthrough as well.","A Level-9 Spiritual Emperor!","She was capable enough to be one of the top cultivators on this continent!","WHAT?!","Wait! What happened?!","The two breakthroughs were unbelievable.","What kind of potion could make a person make a breakthrough so easily? If that was the case, why were they still working so hard?","“A battle between two Level-9 Spiritual Sovereigns! Oh god!”","“This is unprecedented!”","“I remember that the top two were Level-7 Spiritual Sovereigns in the last","Dragon Gate Banquet!”","“That’s right!”"]},{"number":4237,"title":"Chapter 4237: Last War (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4237: Last War (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“This year’s competition is going to be a peak one!”","“I wonder who’s the real winner!”","While everyone was discussing among themselves, Yan Yu stared at Feng Wu with a ferocious look on his face.","The liquid he drank was made from the essence of the dead elders. Had the Luo family sacrificed two elders for her as well?","However, even the elders were willing to sacrifice themselves, but only","Semi-divine medicine refiners could make the liquid. How could Feng Wu...","Feng Wu smiled at him. “Someone once said that I was invincible among my peers. I’d like to know if that’s true.”","Yan Yu smirked. “In your dreams!”","Feng Wu said, “Let’s see who’s the real invincible cultivator!” Thump!","The spiritual essence kept gushing out as they clashed.","The impact sent them flying backward.","Feng Wu stumbled back seven steps, and Yan Yu only took one step to steady himself.","Had the winner been determined?","“IS prince yan YU going to wing”","“He only took one step back, but Feng Wu took seven. I think we know who’s going to win.”","“Feng Wu was so confident just then that I thought she was going to win!”","The crowd believed that Yan Yu was going to win.","Feng Xun and Luo Zilin’s faces were livid.","Meanwhile, the referees all had different expressions on their faces.","The Princess Royal was already laughing. “I see that Prince Yan Yu is going to be first. Master Luo Nantian, what do you think?”","Luo Nantian smiled and didn’t answer the Princess Royal. Instead, he asked another person, “Lord Yan, what do you think?”","With a stern look on his face, Lord Yan stiffened a little. He then stared at Yan Yu without saying a word.","The Princess Royal immediately realized that something wasn’t right. Was she not good enough to see it?","The abbot frowned a little. “Why did Prince Yan Yu insist on holding his ground? He didn’t have to do that.”","As expected, Yan Yu couldn’t take it anymore. He spat out a mouthful of blood.","While he was vomiting blood, Feng Wu struck out.","“Feng Wu, how dare you?!” Frustrated, Lord Yan jumped to his feet and bellowed at Feng Wu!","She was taking advantage of him!","However, one couldn’t afford to be distracted in a battle. She would be a fool if she didn’t take advantage of the situation.","Feng Wu ignored Lord Yan and activated all the spiritual essence she had accumulated over the years.","Thump! Thump! Thump!","It charged at Yan Yu like a tidal wave!","Jumping into the air, the flying sword slashed down at Yan Yu!","The sword was imbued with the power of thunder!","It wrapped around Yan Yu like a giant dragon and exploded!","Even Lord Yan was intimidated.","For Feng Wu was already terrifyingly capable!","Even someone like Lord Yan was only a Spiritual Saint, which was just above a Level-9 Spiritual Sovereign.","Feng Wu wasn’t much weaker than him anymore, and she had borrowed the power of Nature... Wait, where did she get it from?","She had used the power of the Chaotic Nature of the royal family!","Chaotic energy of Nature was the only thing that could break Yan Yu’s defense!"]},{"number":4238,"title":"Chapter 4238: Last War (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4238: Last War (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Only a handful of members of the royal family had inherited the power of Chaotic Nature, so who on earth had lent it to her?","The impact knocked Yan Yu to the ground.","He fell backward with a thump.","Everyone was astonished.","When the lightning dissipated, the sword was no longer there.","Everyone stared at Yan Yu in disbelief. “What happened?”","“Why did Prince Yan Yu fall so suddenly?”","“But he had the upper hand before!”","“Is Prince Yan Yu dead?”","Everyone was curious about the last question.","“Yan Yu!”","Lord Yan rushed up the stage and reached for Yan Yu’s face. His face stiffened and he stared at Feng Wu. “You killed him!”","WHAT?!","Everyone drew in their breaths.","Feng Wu had killed Yan Yu?!","Feng Wu had killed Yan Yu, the Level-9 Spiritual Sovereign!","One strike. That was all it took!","What level was Feng Wu now?","It was terrifying!","Feng Wu said indifferently, “Lord Yan, why do you say that? Prince Yan Yu isn’t dead. He’s still alive.”","Lord Yan’s eyes were bloodshot red. “You destroyed his cultivation ability! He’s as good as dead!”","Not only was Prince Yan Yu his son, but he was also a member of the family and the royal family. He had sacrificed two Level-9 Spiritual Sovereign elders for this, but Feng Wu had crippled him just like that!","The next second, Lord Yan leaped up and reached for Feng Wu’s throat.","Feng Wu had to die if she was caught!","Feng Wu was prepared for this, so she dodged when Lord Yan charged at her.","The next second, Luo Nantian was in front of Feng Wu and blocked Lord Yan’s attack.","“What? Are you going to take your revenge now?” Luo Nantian asked casually.","Lord Yan was going to make another move when Feng Wu smirked. “So, the so-called Dragon Gate Banquet has been decided by the royal family from the very beginning? Only the royal family can win, and the others will get their revenge. Is that it?”","There were so many people around, and Feng Wu’s words were enough to set the mood.","As expected, everyone was talking at the same time.","The people hated it when it was unfair!","Their goal was to be impartial and fair. If Feng Wu was right, the reputation of the Dragon Gate Banquet would be ruined.","Princess Royal had no choice but to rise to her feet. She shot a warning glance at Lord Yan before she forced a smile. “The Dragon Gate Banquet is always fair and open. There’s no such thing as an arranged winner. Miss Feng Wu, you can’t make it up.”","Feng Wu stared at the Princess Royal. “Then what’s Lord Yan doing?","The Princess Royal stared at her. “Lord Yan was just too agitated to see his son like this. Crippling a cultivator’s ability is more painful than killing him. Miss Feng Wu, don’t you think you’re being too malicious?!”","Was she trying to ruin Feng Wu’s reputation?","Feng Wu chuckled. “Didn’t we sign the death contract before the competition started? Did Your Royal Highness think that the competition was a joke? Did you think you could change the rules just like that?”","The princess was rendered speechless by Feng Wu’s words. She didn’t want to embarrass the royal family in front of everyone.."]},{"number":4239,"title":"Chapter 4239: Last War (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4239: Last War (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The Princess Royal said coldly, “What a sharp-tongued girl. You’ve said everything.”","Feng Wu said, “You flatter me. I just want to know who’s going to win this competition. ”","After that, Feng Wu kept her unblinking gaze on the Princess Royal, waiting for an answer.","Feng Wu wasn’t the only one. Right now, the audience was also looking at the Princess Royal to see if she would take Lord Yan’s side.","The Princess Royal was speechless.","She was so mad at Feng Wu!","Feng Wu’s mother was such a goofball and so easy to fool. Why was the girl so difficult to handle? Not only was she sharp-tongued, but she was also very capable!","Having no other choice, Princess Royal had to admit that Feng Wu had won.","“Then?” Feng Wu gave the Princess Royal a half-smile.","What else? The Princess Royal wanted to retort, but when she saw the cold look in Feng Wu’s eyes, she finally realized that she couldn’t take the broken star piece away just like that.","The broken star piece was a treasure for one’s cultivation. As long as one had it with them, they would have an endless supply of spiritual essence.","The Princess Royal narrowed her eyes and hesitated, but she still wouldn’t give the broken star piece to Feng Wu.","“What are you stalling for?” Somehow, Feng Wu felt that something wasn’t right with the Princess Royal, so she narrowed her eyes.","Knowing that she couldn’t stall anymore, the Princess Royal handed the broken star piece to Feng Wu.","The fourth broken star piece!","Feng Wu carefully picked up the fourth broken star piece. She was so absorbed in it that she didn’t notice where the Princess Royal was.","All four broken star pieces would be enough to wake up her beautiful master, and Feng Wu already had three.","As expected, inside Feng Wur s ring space, the fairy was already banging her head against the wall and howling in excitement.","Feng Wu carefully put the broken star piece away in her chest pocket. She had put it in her ring space so that it wouldn’t get lost.","Only the third broken star piece was left, and her third senior brother probably had it. After everything was settled, Feng Wu decided to go to the Sacred Mu Cliff.","Feng Wu hoped that her third senior brother was in the Sacred Mu Cliff.","Just then, Feng Wu realized that something wasn’t right.","Luo Nantian swayed a little.","“Uncle!”","Feng Wu went up to Luo Nantian in a hurry. What was wrong with her uncle?","When Feng Wu looked up, she saw that Luo Nantian’s face had turned blue and his eyes were bloodshot red. He seemed to be in a trance-like state. Feng Wu immediately checked Luo Nantian’s pulse and drew in her breath.","“Bone Eroding Blue Powder!”","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes. Looking down, she saw that the crowd had dispersed, leaving only some offspring of the major families behind. Moreover...","Manv people had fallen to the ground and looked dispirited.","Luo Zilin, Feng Xun, Xuan Yi, and many others fell to the ground.","Qiu Zhennan, Murong Linhai, and Ji Xingcheng all fell to the ground.","Fairy Ziyun, Wuyu, and the others weren’t any better.","Very few people were still standing. What was going on?","Feng Wu turned to look at the Princess Royal. That was right. Right now, only the princess and Lord Yan were still standing there with smiles on their faces.","Therefore, it was obvious who had released the poison.."]},{"number":4240,"title":"Chapter 4240: Bone Eroding Blue Powder","paragraphs":["Chapter 4240: Bone Eroding Blue Powder","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“You’ve poisoned them!”","Feng Wu stared at the Princess Royal and didn’t dare to take a deep breath, for she would be poisoned as well.","The Princess Royal looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment. “Why aren’t you down?”","Feng Wu had an unusual constitution. Most poisons wouldn’t work on her, but the Bone Eroding Blue Powder would. It just wasn’t as potent.","“What do you want?” Feng Wu asked.","That was why she had felt that something was wrong from the very beginning. The Princess Royal had used the Bone Eroding Blue Powder! What was she going to do?","Feng Wu looked at Luo Nantian involuntarily, but his face was livid.","Shit. Feng Wu thought to herself, ‘My uncle probably didn’t expect that the Princess Royal would start a faction war on such an occasion! Nor did the others.”","Who would have thought that the princess would be so insane? There were so many people here!","Feng Wu noticed the confused looks on the faces of Wuyu, Prince Yan Yu, and the others. It was obvious that they were all kept in the dark.","The only ones who knew what was going on were the Princess Royal and Lord Yan, for they were the only ones who were smirking.","“What do I want? Heh —","The Princess Royal smirked. “With everything that has happened, why are you still asking questions? No wonder you’re all prisoners now! Feng Wu, look carefully. Everyone in your clan is on the ground.”","Not only the Luo family, but the neutral forces such as Mountain Sea Academy, the Formless Sword Sect, and the Red Feather Room had all collapsed. No one could fight back.","The head of the academy stared at the Princess Royal in astonishment as well. “What are you doing? Are you going to kill us all?!”","Master Chilian of the Red Feather Room said angrily, “Princess! Do you know the consequences?!”","No one had expected that the Princess Royal would do such a thing. All the major forces had gathered here, and they had all been poisoned!","“Aren’t you afraid of offending everyone?!” One of the members of the Formless Sword Sect bellowed.","The Princess Royal smirked. ” The head of the academy, Master Chilian, and the second-in-command of the Formless Sword Sect, as long as you submit to my Dayan Empire and become one of my subordinate forces, I can promise you that you’ll be as influential as you used to be!”","However, the leaders snorted and didn’t take the Princess Royal’s words seriously because they felt that they had been severely offended.","“Princess Royal, the Murong family has always been on friendly terms with the royal family...” The Murong family’s head couldn’t help but speak up.","The Princess Royal smiled. “Master Murong, are you going to work for the","Dayan Empire now?”","The head of the Murong family nodded. “Of course! We’ll always be loyal to the","Dayan Empire!”","“Good! It’s time to prove your loyalty!” The Princess Royal took a dagger out of her chest pocket and tossed it in front of Master Murong. ‘Go ahead. I’d like to see you try to kill a member of the Luo family.”","Someone was going to die!","No one had expected such a drastic turn of events, but it was great news for Yan Yu and the others.","Holding the dagger, Master Murong took a deep breath.","The Princess Royal asked indifferently, “What? Master Murong, do you not want to offend the Luo family?”","Master Murong shook his head. He knew perfectly well that the Princess Royal was forcing him to do it.."]},{"number":4241,"title":"Chapter 4241: Take Sides","paragraphs":["Chapter 4241: Take Sides","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The Murong family needed to play the role of the vanguard.","Master Murong held a dagger in his hand. After some thought, he turned to Murong Linhai and said, “Pick a member of the Luo family and kill them.”","Murong Linhai was speechless.","Master Murong scolded him. “Go!”","Murong Linhai said, “But... but I can’t stand up...’","Princess Royal gave him a pill.","Murong Linhai regained some strength after taking the pill. Holding the dagger, he rose to his feet and slowly walked toward the Luo family.","Meanwhile, everyone in the Luo family had a grim look on their faces.","It was obvious that the Princess Royal had set the Luo family up. She was going to kill them without giving them a chance to surrender.","Soon, Murong Linhai walked up to Luo Zilin.","Feng Wu’s chest heaved as she tried to force the toxin out of her system so that she could resume her cultivation.","Once she recovered, she would be able to make the antidote in her ring space.","“Stop!” Feng Wu shouted.","Murong Linhai turned around and glanced at Feng Wu.","“You’re not allowed to hurt my brother. Otherwise, I’ll make your family pay a hundred times over!”","Murong Linhai paused for a moment. Just then, the Princess Royal smirked. “Did you hear that? If you let the Luo family live, your family will be punished a hundred times over!”","Master Murong shouted, “Murong Linhai!’","Before Murong Linhai could move, someone said, “If he doesn’t dare to do it, I’ll do it. Princess Royal, please grant my wish.”","It was none other than Fairy Ziyun herself.","She had already pledged her allegiance to the royal family and was under the command of the Princess Royal.","The Princess Royal smiled. “Alright.”","After taking the antidote, Fairy Ziyun had recovered most of her strength, so she walked toward Luo Zilin without hesitation and pressed the dagger to his throat.","“Stop! You can’t hurt him!”","“No, you can’t!”","“Stop!”","Some neutrals chimed in, and the Luo family shouted.","Feng Xun rushed over, trying to push Fairy Ziyun away. However, he was too weak to do anything and fell to the ground.","Master Chilian shouted, “Ziyun, how dare you?!”","Fairy Ziyun gave Master Chilian a contemptuous sidelong glance. “Old hag, just wait and see. It’ll be your turn soon!”","After that, Fairy Ziyun looked at Luo Zilin again.","“Luo Zilin, I’ve put up with you for so long! Die!”","She raised the dagger and stabbed it into Luo Zilin’s heart.","Of course, Feng Wu wouldn’t let that happen. She ran toward Luo Zilin.","Fairy Ziyun grabbed Feng Wu with a smirk. “No? Who the hell do you think you are? You’ll be next after I kill Luo Zilin! So, get lost!”","After that, Fairy Ziyun tossed Feng Wu to the side and walked up to Luo Zilin again.","Feng Wu spat out a mouthful of blood.","Whoosh!","The blade fell, and there was the sound of metal piercing flesh.","Feng Wu suddenly looked at Luo Zilin.","Fairy Ziyun’s dagger pierced Luo Zilin’s chest.","She drew out her dagger, and blood gushed out.","Luo Zilin couldn’t even fight back.","“Brother Zilin!”","“Little Zilin!”","“Zilin!!!”","Everyone was shouting at the same time.."]},{"number":4242,"title":"Chapter 4242: Luo Zilin","paragraphs":["Chapter 4242: Luo Zilin","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","smiled bitterly.","It had never occurred to him that the Luo family would be defeated by the Bone Eroding Blue Powder.","No one had expected the royal family to be so despicable as to do such a thing in front of everyone! They didn’t care about their dignity at all!","looked down at his chest, where blood was gushing out like a fountain. By the look of it, the blood was going to run out.","Feng Wu rushed to Luo Zilin’s side, put a hand over his chest, and comforted him in a low voice. “I’m here. Don’t worry!”","Feng Wu fed her own blood to Luo Zilin as she spoke.","The Princess Royal looked at Feng Wu in surprise.","“You’ve neutralized the poison!” The Princess Royal gritted her teeth.","Feng Wu didn’t have time to reply.","The Princess Royal glanced at Fairy Ziyun.","Fairy Ziyun was working for the Princess Royal now, so Fairy Ziyun knew what to do with one look from the princess.","Without another word, Fairy Ziyun charged at Feng Wu.","Sensing a gust of wind, Feng Wu spun around with Luo Zilin in her arms, dodging the attack. The next second, Feng Wu handed Luo Zilin to Feng Xun, leaving a bag of blood for Feng Xun at an angle where no one could see. Only then did she slowly turn around..","Thump!","When Fairy Ziyun struck again, Feng Wu waved her fists.","Thump!","The impact charged at Fairy Ziyun.","“Ah!”","Fairy Ziyun flew backward and landed on the ground. She spat out a mouthful of blood.","“Ziyun!” The eldest prince went up to her and checked her breathing with his free hand. He realized that Fairy Ziyun was barely breathing.","He stared at Feng Wu in disbelief.","One strike was enough to severely injure Ziyun. Feng Wu was incredible!","“I’ll fight you!” After leaving Fairy Ziyun behind, the crown prince went up to Feng Wu.","Feng Wu smiled a little.","Thump!","Thump! Thump!","After three strikes, the crown prince flew backward and fell to the ground. Just like Fairy Ziyun, he spat out blood right away. “Your Royal Highness!”","Many people cried out in surprise again.","They were astonished when they looked at Feng Wu again.","Feng Wu had defeated Yan Yu, and everyone knew that she was the most capable cultivator of her generation. However, no one had expected that she could defeat the crown prince, the winner of the last Dragon Gate Banquet, with three strikes!","What a genius!","The Princess Royal looked from the crown prince to Feng Wu with a grim smile on her face.","“Princess Royal, are you not convinced? Bring it on.” Feng Wu smirked.","“Princess Royal, you’re so precious. Why don’t you let me...” Someone was going to take the princess’s place.","Meanwhile, someone was staring at Feng Wu in astonishment. It was none other than Feng Yanbing, Feng Wu’s father.","Feng Yanbing stood there in a trance-like state with his mouth agape. He was too shocked to utter a word.","Feng Wu was an unmatched genius!","What did he do to deserve such a genius child? Feng Yanbing was so excited that he almost laughed. He couldn’t help but smile a little.","“You go!” The Princess Royal stared at Feng Yanbing.."]},{"number":4243,"title":"Chapter 4243: Feng Yanbing","paragraphs":["Chapter 4243: Feng Yanbing","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","didn’t know what to say. “What?”","The Princess Royal said coldly, “Take her down.”","only realized what was going on when he saw the cold look in the Princess Royal’s eyes. That was right. The girl wasn’t on their side now.","“Quickly.” The Princess Royal prompted him.","gritted his teeth and said in the end, “I can’t take her down. You know that. I’m not a Level-8 Spiritual Sovereign yet.”","Feng Wu was a Level-9 Spiritual Sovereign now.","The Princess Royal smirked. “Aren’t you his father? If she doesn’t listen to you and surrenders, she’ll be considered an unfilial daughter!” mumbled, “Listen to me? She has even hit me.”","The Princess Royal didn’t expect that Feng Yanbing would say such a thing. She was furious. “Fine! If that’s the case, I’ll kill her myself!” wanted to tell her that the girl hadn’t shown her full capability yet, but he couldn’t bring himself to say it. If he did, the Princess Royal would be on guard, and the genius girl would be in danger.","The Princess Royal looked at Feng Wu.","She was a capable cultivator and had been making breakthroughs recently, so she was very confident in herself.","However, when she actually fought Feng Wu, she suddenly felt an endless amount of pressure.","Thump! Thump! Thump!","In the battle between Feng Wu and the princess, everyone had thought that the princess would be able to take Feng Wu down, but as it turned out...","“How dare you, Feng Wu!”","Princess Royal was hit in the belly and felt that her dantian had been severely injured. A burning sensation ran through her body. She broke into a cold sweat.","However, Feng Wu didn’t give her any chance. She stepped forward and grabbed the Princess Royal by her throat.","“Stop!”","Lord Yan didn’t expect that Feng Wu would be able to subdue the Princess Royal so easily. He frowned and felt even more frustrated.","If he had known this would happen, he would have killed the girl already. He wouldn’t have to go through all this trouble. Lord Yan blamed the Princess Royal for being nosy, but he couldn’t say anything now. He had to stop Feng wu.","Holding the dagger to the Princess Royal’s throat, Feng Wu said coldly, “Hand over the antidote.”","The Princess Royal smirked. “An antidote? What antidote?”","Feng Wu asked, “What do you think?”","The Princess Royal said confidently, “So, you’re talking about the antidote for","Bone Eroding Blue Powder. Sorry, I never prepared it in the first place.”","Feng Wu said, “I see that you don’t feel like a hostage at all.”","The Princess Royal smirked. “What can you possibly do to me? You wouldn’t dare!”","Feng Wu said, “You’re my senior, aren’t you? Are you proud of yourself when","I’ve defeated you?”","That hurt... The Princess Royal gritted her teeth and said to Lord Yan, “Kill everyone in the Luo family!”","The next second, the Princess Royal felt a pain in her throat as something fell into her stomach.","Feng Wu tossed her aside.","“What did you feed me?”","The Princess Royal was astonished.","It wouldn’t be so bad if the Princess Royal knew what kind of pill Feng Wu gave her, but she didn’t.","The unknown was the most frightening thing because the imagination could frighten her. “Take Feng Wu down! Now!”","“Let me do it, then!”","The head of the Murong family finally stepped out.."]},{"number":4244,"title":"Chapter 4244: Master Murong","paragraphs":["Chapter 4244: Master Murong","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The Princess Royal had told him to kill a member of the Luo family, but he had given the task to Murong Linhai. As a result, he had stalled for so long. He was worried that if he didn’t step out now, he would really offend the Princess Royal.","The Princess Royal threw a dirty look at Master Murong. “Master Murong, I’m counting on you. Catch her and don’t let her die!”","The Princess Royal was still waiting for Feng Wu’s antidote!","While Feng Wu was fighting Master Murong, an imperial physician came up to treat the Princess Royal.","“Do you know what poison it is?” The Princess Royal stared at the imperial physician.","However, the imperial physician only remained silent. In the end, he shook his head with a solemn look on his face, indicating that he couldn’t do anything about it.","“Useless!” The Princess Royal gritted her teeth.","Meanwhile, the head of the Murong family was fighting Feng Wu.","The head of the Murong family was at least a Level-10 Spiritual Sovereign, but he still hadn’t defeated Feng Wu!","The head of the Murong family had thought that he could take Feng Wu down right away, and so did everyone else. However, that didn’t happen. It was like a slap on his face!","“I didn’t know you were so capable. I’ve underestimated you.” Master Murong stared at Feng Wu with a grim look in his eyes.","Soon, they exchanged blows again.","The audience watched the battle with wide-open eyes.","Seriously?","The royal family thought, “Master Murong has made at least ten strikes, but he still can’t defeat Feng Wu!”","The Luo family thought, “Feng Wu was able to withstand ten strikes without showing any signs of defeat!”","Since when was Feng Wu so capable?!","Feng Yanbing couldn’t help but say to the Princess Royal. “See? I told you already. That girl is incredible. She’s getting stronger every night.” The Princess Royal glared at Feng Yanbing. “Shut up!”","Feng Yanbing rubbed his nose. The girl was his own daughter!","Seeing how pleased he was, the Princess Royal was even angrier.","She stared at Master Murong and snorted. ‘Master Murong, are you going easy on her to buy her more time?”","Of course, the head of the Muronq familv didn’t dare to take the blame. He had no choice but to use his ultimate move.","He opened his palm, and a Sky Thunder Hammer appeared in his right hand.","“Little girl, you’re going to die!”","The wind created by the hammer seemed to be able to crush heaven and earth.","The formidable power wrapped around the hammer and charged at Feng Wu like a giant mountain!","“Watch out!” Feng Xun clenched his fists nervously.","Feng Wu dodged the strike, but her right arm was hit, and there was a loud thump. She stumbled and was almost knocked away.","Patriarch Murong was surprised.","There were three stances in total, and one of them was enough to make him invincible, not to mention that she wasn’t as advanced as he was. To his surprise, Feng Wu dodged the first strike.","“The second stance!”","Boom!","The Heavenly Thunder Hammer turned into a streak of lightning, which smashed the air around Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was running as fast as she could, but she still wasn’t as fast as Master Murong.","When the lightning dissipated, Feng Wu’s face was almost charred, and she was covered with cuts and bruises. She didn’t have any intact skin left.","From afar, she looked like a charred puppet.."]},{"number":4245,"title":"Chapter 4245: Sacred Mu Cliff","paragraphs":["Chapter 4245: Sacred Mu Cliff","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Master Murong looked excited.","Finally!","Finally, Feng Wu was severely injured.","That was to say, his ultimate move was still the ultimate move.","“The third stance!”","Master Murong activated his most powerful stance without hesitation.","Everyone in the Luo family was terrified.","Feng Xun was so anxious that he wanted to rush onto the stage.","They all saw that Feng Wu seemed to have been struck dumb by the second strike. She just stood there and couldn’t dodge the third one.","She was going to die!","“Stop!”","Countless voices rang out.","However, Master Murong only smirked and showed no mercy. At that critical moment, a cold voice rang out. “How dare you! Stop!”","As he spoke, a figure blocked Feng Wu’s way and parried the strike.","Thump!","The hammer was thrown away, and Master Murong stumbled back.","Immediately, all eyes were on him.","Who was he?","Meanwhile, Feng Wu looked pleasantly surprised.","He was Patriarch Helian of the Junwu Continent and her sixth senior brother.","Feng Xun and the others recognized the old man as well and were pleasantly surprised.","“It’s him! It’s him!”","“It’s Patriarch Helian! He’s here to save us!”","“Wait, there’s another person with Patriarch Helian. Who is he?”","“Master Linghu! Gosh, it’s him! He’s the pillar of the Junwu Empire! I thought he wasn’t allowed to leave the empire! Why is he here?!”","That was right. Next to Patriarch Helian was none other than Master Linghu, Feng Wu’s fifth senior brother.","Because Feng Wu had been told not to let other people know who she really was, she couldn’t address them as Senior Brothers in front of other people. Therefore, Feng Wu still addressed them as Patriarch Helian and Master Linghu.","Patriarch Helian patted Feng Wu on the head. “You’ve had a hard time.” Master Linghu smiled at Feng Wu affectionately.","While they were enjoying themselves, the other side was displeased.","Patriarch Murong stared at the two people and found them familiar, but he still couldn’t recognize them.","Princess Royal, on the other hand, narrowed her eyes and finally remembered who the people were.","“It’s you!” The Princess Royal pointed at Patriarch Helian and Master Linghu. “You’re Mu Jiuzhou’s pupil!”","Mu Jiuzhou!!!","A hush fell over the crowd at those words.","Mu Jiuzhou was an invincible figure in both the Junwu Continent and the Dayan Empire.","Hearing what the Princess Royal said, Lord Yan and the others looked at them in astonishment.","Ever since Mu Jiuzhou went missing, the six disciples of the Sacred Mu Cliff either left the empire or lived in seclusion. Because of that, Princess Royal, Lord Yan, and the others didn’t include the Sacred Mu Cliff in their plan.","But now, the disciples of Sacred Mu Cliff had come out of seclusion, and there were two of them!","Recalling the feud between Mu Jiuzhou and the royal family, the Princess Royal frowned. She had a bad feeling, but in order to make her plan work, she had to put away her emotions and smile.","“You’re Mr.. Linghu, Lord Mu’s fifth pupil, aren’t you?”"]},{"number":4246,"title":"Chapter 4246: The Finale (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4246: The Finale (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Master Linghu nodded.","“You’re Mr. Helian, the sixth pupil of Master Mu, aren’t you?”","Patriarch Helian nodded as well.","The Princess Royal smiled obsequiously. “You’ve come from afar, and I’m sorry for not greeting you. As for what happened here, it has nothing to do with the Sacred Mu Cliff. Please mind your own business and don’t cause trouble for them.”","The Princess Royal thought that since she had shown her attitude, the other party should feel honored. However, Patriarch Helian smirked and said, “You don’t have to tell me what to do in the Sacred Mu Cliff!”","The Princess Royal asked coldly, “Are you sure you want to get involved?”","Patriarch Helian and Master Linghu chuckled. They didn’t say much, but the meaning was obvious.","The Princess Royal smirked. “With the current situation, are you really going to die with the Luo family?”","Patriarch Helian said, “Are you sure about that?”","Only then was Princess Royal convinced that the two men had come prepared.","“Why are you doing this?” The Princess Royal asked the question everyone wanted to ask. “Why are you helping the Luo family?”","Patriarch Helian smiled. “We’ve never helped the Luo family, but Feng Wu.”","Everyone drew in their breaths.","Feng Wu? What did Feng Wu have anything to do with it?","Feng Xun raised his chin in satisfaction. Of course, it was for Xiao Wu. Xiao Wu was very close to these two elders!","“Is it worth it to drag the Sacred Mu Cliff down with her?” The Princess Royal gritted her teeth.","“People of the Sacred Mu Cliff are not to be trifled with!” Patriarch Helian glared at the Princess Royal.","The Princess Royal asked, “Who did that to the people of the Sacred Mu Cliff?”","Everyone knew that the Sacred Mu Cliff wasn’t to be messed with, so they had always been polite. No one would dare to pick on them.","Patriarch Helian said, “You.”","Princess Royal said, “No, I didn’t.”","Patriarch Helian pointed at Feng Wu. “You’ve bullied her.”","The Princess Royal said, “She’s not from the Sacred Mu Cliff.”","Patriarch Helian said, “She is.”","Immediately, everyone drew in their breaths again.","What? Feng Wu was from the Sacred Mu Cliff?","Even Feng Xun was astonished. He was so close to Feng Wu that he didn’t know the girl’s relationship with the Sacred Mu Cliff!","So was the Princess Royal. “What did you say?!”","Patriarch Helian said, “She’s our junior sister. Why isn’t she from the Sacred Mu Cliff?”","Even Feng Wu was surprised. Didn’t her Sixth Senior Brother tell her not to tell anyone that she was his Master’s pupil? Why did he tell her now?","WHAT?!","What?!!!","Apart from a handful of people, the rest of the crowd watched this with wide-open eyes.","Who were they kidding? How could Feng Wu be their junior sister?","“That’s impossible!” The Princess Royal was the first to cry out. “Does that mean she’s Master Mu’s pupil? We’ve never heard of a female pupil in the Sacred Mu Cliff! Have you heard of her?”","Master Murong and the others shook their heads. They had never heard of such a thing before.","“Master Mu is long gone. He’s never going to have a female student. That’s bullshit!” Lord Yan smirked.","Master Murong asked, “Are you taking in a pupil on behalf of your master?” Immediately, all eyes were on Patriarch Helian and Master Linghu.","Patriarch Helian smirked. “You may not believe it, but my master really took","her in..”"]},{"number":4247,"title":"Chapter 4247: The Finale (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4247: The Finale (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Lord Yan stressed, “That’s impossible. Master Mu is long dead. How can he still have a new pupil? That’s impossible!”","Patriarch Helian smirked. “Who knows what happened in the Sacred Mu Cliff better? You or us?”","Lord Yan was speechless.","The Princess Royal stepped forward. “Are you saying that... Master Mu isn’t dead?!”","Patriarch Helian only smiled.","The Princess Royal suddenly turned around and met Lord Yan’s eyes. Both looked terrified.","The relationship between Master Mu and the royal family was very bad. If he wasn’t dead...","But Lord Yan shook his head affirmatively. “No, he’s dead!”","He had seen it with his own eyes!","Saying that he was missing was only an excuse. In fact, Master Mu was dead! Completely dead!","At that thought, Lord Yan shook his head at the Princess Royal.","Only then did Princess Royal let out a breath of relief.","Helian only smirked when he saw their interaction.","Lord Yan stared at Patriarch Helian and narrowed his eyes. “So, the two of you made the decision on your own?”","Without Master Mu, the Sacred Mu Cliff was still very powerful, but not invincible.","“I was going to take care of the Sacred Mu Cliff after I took care of the Luo family, but you just happened to run into me. Since that’s the case, I’ll take care of you all today.” Lord Yan smiled.","As he spoke, he shot warning glances at the Princess Royal, Patriarch Murong, and the abbot.","The Luo family had been hit by the powder, and so had the neutral forces like the Mountain Sea Academy. They were practically defenseless. Now, there were only two people from the Sacred Mu Cliff. Did they think they could turn things around?","“The four of us can do it together.”","To be on the safe side, Lord Yan decided that it would be four against two.","The four of them nodded and each took a corner so that their opponent wouldn’t run away.","To their surprise, Patriarch Helian didn’t try to run away. Instead, he gave Lord Yan a confused look, which made Lord Yan’s heart skip a beat. He had a very bad feeling.","He was right.","The next moment, they heard a taunting voice.","“How dare you pick on the people of Sacred Mu Cliff?!”","That was a familiar voice.","Feng Wu looked up involuntarily and saw people coming their way.","One was her third senior brother, whom she was familiar with, and the other one... Feng Wu hadn’t met him before.","However, since he was here with her third senior brother, Feng Wu could roughly guess who he was.","As expected, Patriarch Helian said to Feng Wu, “Do you see that blue-robed scholar? He’s your fourth senior brother. ”","He was dressed like a Confucian scholar and had a book in his hand. He looked elegant and carefree.","In comparison, her third senior brother was a pure swordsman, and he looked as cold as ice.","Feng Wu greeted them in a hurry. “Senior Brothers.”","The third senior brother nodded and gave Feng Wu a gentle look.","Her fourth senior brother beamed at Feng Wu. “So, you’re the last pupil of my master. Come here and let me have a look.”","Since all the disciples of the Sacred Mu Cliff had addressed Feng Wu as their junior sister, it meant that...","Feng Wu really was their junior sister, and Helian wasn’t lying! The Princess Royal was so displeased. She didn’t know that Feng Wu could be so lucky! Meanwhile, Feng Wu had finished greeting her senior brothers.."]},{"number":4248,"title":"Chapter 4248: The Finale (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4248: The Finale (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Ignoring the impending battle, Feng Wu dragged her third senior brother to the side.","Their departure attracted a lot of attention, but because of Patriarch Helian, both the Princess Royal and Lord Yan were distracted.","Feng Wu stopped Chu Tianxiao, her third senior brother, and asked in a low voice, “Senior Brother, have you found the third broken star piece?”","Feng Wu had told her third senior brother about the broken star piece waking up her beautiful master.","Her third senior brother had entered the Dayan Empire earlier to look for it.","Chu Tianxiao frowned a little.","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched. Seriously? He still hadn’t found it?","The third senior brother paused for a moment before sighing. “The difficult part is finding the rest. There are four in total...”","Feng Wu grabbed his sleeve in excitement. “Senior Brother, are you saying that you have the third broken star piece? You do, don’t you?!” Chu Tianxiao was cold to everyone except for Feng Wu.","He rubbed Feng Wu’s head. “Yes.”","Feng Wu said, “Give it to me! Now!”","Chu Tianxiao showed Feng Wu the broken star piece. “There are too many people here, and it won’t be easy to find it if we lose it. I’ll keep it for now until we’re somewhere safe. We won’t be able to handle them if there are only a few of them. The royal family still has a few capable cultivators, and I don’t think I can handle them all. So, you can leave now!”","After that, Chu Tianxiao was going to send Feng Wu away.","However, Feng Wu grabbed the broken star piece in Chu Tianxiao’s hand in excitement. “Senior Brother! Master will be with us!”","Before Chu Tianxiao could ask, Feng Wu had taken the broken star piece. Just then, the battle started.","Chu Tianxiao told Feng Wu, “Find a safe place to hide first!”","After that, Chu Tianxiao joined the battle.","A battle between top cultivators was taking place.","Patriarch Murong, the abbot, the Princess Royal, and Lord Yan were facing Feng Wu’s four senior brothers.","On any other day, Feng Wu would have joined the battle already, for if she did, the Sacred Mu Cliff would have a great chance of winning. However. Feng Wu","didn’t have time to do that now.","Her third senior brother had just revealed that there was a very capable cultivator behind the Dayan Empire.","The only thing she could do now was to send the broken star piece into her ring space as soon as possible so that her beautiful master could wake up.","In a corner where no one could see, Feng Wu leaned against the wall and entered the ring space.","Inside, Little Phoenix and the fairy were looking at Feng Wu in excitement, for they had heard the conversation between Feng Wu and Chu Tianxiao.","Little Phoenix was so excited that its voice trembled.","“The third broken star piece? The third? The third?!”","Feng Wu immediately took out the third broken star piece and showed it to Little Phoenix.","Little Phoenix cried out and fainted.","Feng Wu put it aside grumpily, then put all four broken star pieces in her master’s heart.","All these years, her beautiful master had been lying on the cold jade bed with his eyes closed. He had remained unaffected by the passage of time.","Staring at that stunning face, Feng Wu slowly knelt down in front of him. Before she knew it, she was in tears.","“Master...”"]},{"number":4249,"title":"Chapter 4249: The Finale (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4249: The Finale (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Master...”","Feng Wu sobbed, trying to make up for all the hardships she had gone through.","Seeing the four broken star pieces condense into a complete star above her beautiful master, Feng Wu smiled with teary eyes.","Her beautiful master was going to wake up. She was sure of it.","Just then, the fairy reminded Feng Wu, “We’re losing the battle!”","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up. Her senior brothers had been fighting the royal family when she came in, and it didn’t look like they were going to lose. Had reinforcements come again?","Feng Wu looked at her beautiful master...","The fairy said anxiously, “Don’t worry. I’ll keep an eye on him for you. I’m sure nothing will happen to your master!”","By then, Little Phoenix had woken up as well. It promised Feng Wu that it would keep an eye on the master and wouldn’t let anything happen.","Feng Wu said in a serious tone, “I’ll go out now. You guys have to guard my master!”","Little Phoenix and the fairy nodded in unison.","Just then, Feng Wu stepped out and saw that the Dayan Empire had indeed sent reinforcements!","A person that looked like a eunuch had joined the battle. Her senior brothers used to have the upper hand, but because of the eunuch, her team began to lose ground.","Without another word, Feng Wu joined the fight and confronted the Princess Royal with her.","The princess had lost to Feng Wu before, and Feng Wu had thought that she could easily defeat her. However, the princess drank a bottle of blood-colored D0tion!","It was exactly the same as the one Yan Yu used before!","After drinking it, the princess made a breakthrough and reached Level 10 of the Spiritual Emperor stage.","Feng Wu was speechless.","The Princess Royal sneered at Feng Wu. “Do you really think I can’t do anything to you? I’ve been suppressing my breakthrough, that’s all. I’m Level 10 now, and you’re only a Level 9 Spiritual Sovereign. You have no chance!”","“Die!”","The battle between the Princess Royal and Feng Wu grew more intense.","Even with Feng Wu’s help, Princess Royal was still gaining ground. The chief eunuch was able to keep Chu Tianxiao busy so that he wouldn’t have time to help other senior brothers.","Master Lv, the chief eunuch, smirked at Chu Tianxiao. “Mr. Chu, you can’t do it on your own. Where are your senior brothers?”","Just then, a voice came from afar. “Dao Yu, the second disciple of Sacred Mu Cliff, is here!”","“Hua Yangzi, the eldest pupil of the Sacred Mu Cliff, is here.” Feng Wu looked up and saw the two people coming their way.","Dao Yu was tall, strong, and full of power.","Hua Yangzi, on the other hand, looked like a sage.","Feng Wu could sense that the Princess Royal was moving faster and faster.","The chief eunuch, who had been fighting Chu Tianxiao, had a cold look in his eyes as well.","“Master Lv, it’s been a while.” The sage-like Hua Yangzi smiled and looked at him. “Master Lv is the chief steward of the imperial palace and one of the top three members of the royal family. Your cultivation level is higher than my third junior brother’s. Would you like to fight me?”","Master Lv’s face was livid.","He was indeed a level higher than Chu Tianxiao, but in actual combat, he was only Chu Tianxiao’s equal. That was to say, Chu Tianxiao would be able to crush him once he made the breakthrough.","As for Dao Yu and Hua Yangzi, the two top cultivators of Sacred Mu Cliff, Master Lv had no chance at all.."]},{"number":4250,"title":"Chapter 4250: The Finale (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4250: The Finale (5)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Meanwhile, the others were astonished.","“It’s such a big scene...” The head of the Mountain Sea Academy watched this in amazement and murmured to Luo Nantian, “All six disciples of Sacred Mu Cliff are here!”","Luo Nantian pressed a hand to his chest. “Seven.”","The principal said, “That’s right. And there’s your girl.”","Luo Nantian smiled bitterly. Even he didn’t know that his girl was so well-connected.","“You didn’t know about her relationship with the Sacred Mu Cliff?” The principal looked at Luo Nantian in amazement.","Luo Nantian snorted.","The principal smiled. “That’s true. Master Mu had so much conflict with the royal family back then. If they find out that she’s Master Mu’s pupil, the royal family won’t let her off the hook. For safety’s sake, we should keep it a secret.’","Luo Nantian knew that as well, so he didn’t blame Feng Wu. He was just a little upset.","The principal sighed with emotion. “It’s all thanks to that girl. Otherwise, our forces would have been doomed.”","Luo Nantian said, “The Mountain Sea Academy would probably be alright, but the Luo family would have been doomed.”","The principal smiled bitterly. “I don’t believe that you don’t know what the","Princess Royal meant. Without the Luo family, the entire Mountain Sea Academy would be at the mercy of the royal family. Do you think we’ll have a good life?”","While he was talking, Luo Nantian moved closer to the principal and handed him the remaining half of the blood when no one was looking.","The principal asked, “What’s that?”","Luo Nantian said, “That’s the antidote.”","The principal couldn’t hide the surprise on his face. “What?!” The antidote?!","Where did Luo Nantian get the antidote? Who gave him the antidote? Why did he get it all of a sudden? Why didn’t the principal know anything?","Luo Nantian said grumpily, “Of course, it’s from Xiao Wu. Can’t you see that she has neutralized the poison?”","That was right! The principal recalled that Feng Wu had joined the battle and was engaged in a fierce battle with the Princess Royal, which proved that Feng Wu had really neutralized the toxin!","“Quickly.” Luo Nantian handed the half-bottle to the principal, who immediately hid it in his sleeve.","Luo Nantian was already trying to neutralize the toxin and regain his freedom.","Master Lv stared at Hua Yangzi and smirked. “Do you really think no one can handle you?”","“Master, are you there?”","At those words, a figure in gray appeared next to him.","Lord Yan was astonished.","“It’s the Saint Elder One!”","The elder used to be the head of the eunuchs. He was Master Lv’s master and the Emperor Emeritus’ servant. However, he disappeared when the Emperor Emeritus went into seclusion.","But now, the Saint Elder One showed up.","The current emperor showed up with him as well.","“Your Majesty!”","Immediately, everyone saw the ambitious emperor, who wanted to annex all the continents and restore the glory of the empire.","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes.","Emperor Yan didn’t try to hide his intimidating aura at all.","Both teams should have sent their players out by now.","The royal family consisted of Emperor Dayan, the Sacred Elder One, Master Lv, Lord Yan, the Princess Royal, the head of the Murong family, and the abbot.","The Luo family consisted of Hua Yangzi, Dao Yu, Chu Tianxiao, the Sage of Calligraphy, Master Linghu, Patriarch Helian, and Feng Wu.."]},{"number":4251,"title":"Chapter 4251: The Finale (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4251: The Finale (6)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Luo Nantian and the DrinciDal would soon recover their cultivation abilitv. so Feng Wu thought she still had a chance.","Emperor Yan sat on the highest seat and stared at the audience.","“Disciples of the Sacred Mu Cliff, I see...” Emperor Yan smirked. “Good.","Everyone’s here.”","Hua Yangzi stared at Emperor Yan with brooding eyes. “Your Majesty, what’s that supposed to mean?”","Emperor Yan said, “It’s usually very difficult to find you, let alone gather all of you here. I’m so glad that you’ve all gathered here in the imperial capital.’ “Lord Yan, good job.” Emperor Yan praised him.","Lord Yan smiled bitterly. At first, he didn’t know that he could gather this many people from the Sacred Mu Cliff. However, he was reassured by His Majesty’s words.","“It’s all thanks to Your Majesty’s brilliant plan. I’m only following orders.” Lord Yan was filled with reverence toward Emperor Yan.","Hua Yangzi stared at Emperor Yan and suddenly asked, “Your Majesty, were you behind my master’s disappearance?”","Hua Yangzi had been investigating the matter for the past few years, and after a series of detailed analyses, he pointed the finger at Emperor Yan.","Emperor Yan smiled. “I didn’t know that after all these years, you’ve finally found me. That couldn’t have been easy.”","It was an ambiguous statement. He neither admitted nor denied it as if he had given tacit consent.","Not everyone in the Sacred Mu Cliff was as level-headed as their senior brother. At that moment, Patriarch Helian couldn’t help but say angrily, “So, you’re the one who has injured my master. You deserve to die!” Emperor Yan smiled. “I didn’t injure him. I killed him.” Kill...","The Sacred Mu Cliff cultivators’ faces turned livid. Hua Yangzi smirked. “Master isn’t dead yet.”","Emperor Yan said, “No, he’s dead. I killed him myself.”","Hua Yangzi said, “Master isn’t dead.”","Emperor Yan guffawed. “I tricked him into drinking the poison, skinning him, removing his tendons, and draining his blood. He’s as dead as a doornail!” Feng Wu stared at him and wanted to tear his hand off.","Emperor Yan guffawed. “My third brother should never have been so benevolent as to try to save that child. Of course, I had to kill him! I couldn’t hand the empire over to that kid!”","Huh? Feng Wu didn’t understand.","It was a feud of the older generations, and it was a secret of the royal family. Feng Wu was sure that many people here didn’t understand it, apart from those few bosses.","Seeing the confused look on Feng Wu’s face, Luo Nantian explained to her, “The previous emperor had three outstanding princes. The crown prince was the oldest son, and His Majesty was the second. Master Mu, on the other hand, was the third prince.”","What? Feng Wu looked at Luo Nantian in amazement. Her beautiful master used to be a royal prince?","Luo Nantian nodded and said, “The three princes are all very talented and capable, and each of them is enough to make the Dayan Empire prosper for 500 years. However, they’re all too outstanding.","“The crown prince was an excellent cultivator, but he had his shortcomings, which were that he was too weak. Together with everything that happened back then, the crown prince died in the end, leaving behind a baby.” Luo Nantian explained to Feng Wu. “I think there’s something fishy about what happened to the late crown prince.","“The late prince was poisoned by His Majesty..”"]},{"number":4252,"title":"Chapter 4252: The Finale (7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4252: The Finale (7)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“The late prince was poisoned by His Majesty.”","A calm voice came from a short distance away. When they turned around, they saw that it was Hua Yangzi.","“Back then, Master said that His Majesty had poisoned the late crown prince to death with a slow-acting Bone Eroding Blue Powder, which could slowly kill people without them Imowing it.","Immediately, all eyes were on Emperor Yan.","Emperor Yan remained unmoved and said unhurriedly, “Don’t slander me. You said that you heard from my third brother, but where is he? I’ll accept it if you tell him to come out.”","Where was Master Mu?","No one knew where Master Mu was. According to the emperor, Master Mu was dead.","Touching his bright yellow belt, Emperor Yan laughed. “Your Master Mu is long dead. Do you know where his tendons are?”","All eyes were on Emperor Yan’s belt.","Emperor Yan said, “How dare he try to assassinate me? I won’t let him do that! I killed him fair and square! ”","Hua Yangzi said, “You’re lying!”","Emperor Yan said, “Back then, he tried to kill the only bloodline of the late crown prince. If both the baby and I were dead, he would own the empire. I couldn’t have let that happen!”","Even the disciples of the Sacred Mu Cliff were infuriated. This emperor was such a liar!","“Otherwise, tell him to come out. As soon as he does, I’ll believe you! Heh!” Emperor Yan boasted. Just then, he heard a calm voice.","“Is that so?”","A tall, haughty, and graceful figure appeared in front of them.","“Master!!!”","Feng Wu was the first to react. She rushed to her beautiful master’s side and held his arm. “Master!”","“Master!”","“Master!!!”","Everyone was excited.","Hua Yangzi, Dao Yu, Chu Tianxiao, the Sage of Calligraphy, Master Linghu, and Patriarch Helian were all people who loved their masters more than their own lives. They all burst into tears when they saw Mu Jiuzhou.","Even Hua Yangzi, the most reserved of them all, dropped to his knees and greeted his master with tears in his eyes.","Mu Jiuzhou looked up at his pupils before his gaze landed on Feng Wu. He patted his pupil on the head and sighed with emotion. “I didn’t know that you would save my life in the end. You’ve had a tough journey.”","Recalling all the hardships she had gone through, Feng Wu burst into tears. Mu Jiuzhou rubbed her head and didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. “You crybaby.”","Feng Wu was as persistent as ever, but to her master, she was that little girl.","The principal nudged Luo Nantian. “Master Mu! It’s him!”","The third prince that they used to think highly of!","Luo Nantian was equally shocked.","They had thought that the third prince was dead, but he had come back to life!","If Master Mu had been the emperor, the Luo family wouldn’t have had so many conflicts with the royal family, and things wouldn’t have turned out this way. The Luo family used to support Master Mu!","Meanwhile, Mu Jiuzhou was walking toward Emperor Yan.","Emperor Yan rose to his feet in astonishment, and his pupils contracted.","“Why are you still alive?”","He was supposed to be dead!"]},{"number":4253,"title":"Chapter 4253: The Finale (8)","paragraphs":["Chapter 4253: The Finale (8)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Because I have a great pupil,” Mu Jiuzhou said indifferently. “That’s why I’m alive again. My dear brother.”","Emperor Yan stumbled back.","Back then, he wasn’t Mu Jiuzhou’s match, but Mu Jiuzhou was caught off guard, which gave him the chance to poison him. It almost destroyed Mu Jiuzhou’s cultivation ability, which was why Emperor Yan was able to get what he wanted. But now, Mu Jiuzhou was back.","Mu Jiuzhou was the only person that Emperor Yan was afraid of.","“Stay away from me!”","But Mu Jiuzhou still walked toward him.","“Stop! Stop! Saint Elder One! Stop him!” Emperor Yan bellowed.","Meanwhile, the Elder One stared at Mu Jiuzhou in bewilderment.","Back then, the Emperor Emeritus favored the third prince. However, the current emperor had harmed Mu Jiuzhou and Emperor Emeritus’s grandson, which was why he was able to inherit the throne. As it turned out, he wasn’t the rightful ruler.","“Elder One! What are you doing?!” Emperor Yan panicked and bellowed again.","The elder cupped his hands at Emperor Yan. “We’ll have to report to Emperor","Emeritus first before making a decision.”","Back then, Emperor Emeritus went into seclusion and didn’t pay much attention to worldly affairs. When he came out of seclusion, there was only one son left, and he was the only one who could inherit the throne.","The elder then turned to leave.","Emperor Yan said, “He wanted to kill my father’s grandson! It wasn’t me!”","He used to be the intimidating emperor, but when Mu Jiuzhou was around, all he could do was scream.","“I want to kill the emperor’s grandson?” Mu Jiuzhou smirked. “If that was true, he wouldn’t be alive for much longer.”","“What do you mean? He’s still alive?” Emperor Yan was astonished.","“I am.”","A figure appeared in front of them.","It was none other than Jun Linyuan, the late crown prince’s grandson! Meanwhile, Jun Linyuan was strolling toward them with an old man.","“Jun Linyuan! ”","Fenz Wu couldn’t care less about anvthinz else. She Quicklv ran toward Jun","Linyuan.","Jun Linyuan rubbed Feng Wu’s head and smiled at her.","Feng Wu almost burst into tears again.","She didn’t see this coming.","Had it not been for the help of her six senior brothers and her master, who Imew what would have happened to her?","“I almost died...” Feng Wu tugged at Jun Linyuan’s sleeve and wheedled.","A gentle look flickered in Jun Linyuan’s brooding eyes, which seemed to burn with passion. “I’ll protect you for as long as you want.” He felt his ears burning when he heard that.","“Ahem.” Someone cleared their throat.","Looking up, Feng Wu saw that the man was wearing a bright yellow robe, which gave him a sage-like look, which was both majestic and elegant. Feng Wu could sense how weak the man was. He didn’t seem to be feeling well.","Feng Wu looked at Jun Linyuan in bewilderment.","Jun Linyuan whispered something in Feng Wu’s ear.","Feng Wu was surprised.","So, he was the Emperor Emeritus!","And he had taught all his skills to Jun Linyuan!","Jun Linyuan had to be so capable now, right?","“You?” Emperor Yan was dumbfounded when he saw Jun Linyuan’s face.","He had seen that face before!","Jun Linyuan looked like someone. He looked like the crown prince’s wife!","The crown prince’s wife that the current emperor had humiliated to death!","So, he was...","“I am the grandson.”","Jun Linyuan slowly walked toward Emperor Yan.."]},{"number":4254,"title":"Chapter 4254: The End","paragraphs":["Chapter 4254: The End","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Things didn’t end well for Emperor Yan.","Not only did he offend Mu Jiuzhou, but he also offended Jun Linyuan. These two weren’t to be trifled with.","No one knew what would happen to Emperor Yan in the end.","Feng Wu only found out after asking Jun Linyuan.","“Was Emperor Yan executed by a thousand cuts?” Holding half of the melon like a hamster, Feng Wu bit into it as she asked Jun Linyuan.","Jun Linyuan sat down opposite her, nodded, and said, “Even if I’m willing to let him go, my uncle won’t let me.”","Naturally, Jun Linyuan was referring to Mu Jiuzhou. Feng Wu nodded. “What about the throne now?”","Jun Linyuan felt a headache coming on as well.","“My uncle doesn’t want that position.” Jun Linyuan rubbed his temples.","Feng Wu said, “And you don’t want the job either.”","Jun Linyuan nodded.","Feng Wu sighed. “Emperor Yan wouldn’t let go of the throne, but you dragged him down. Now that neither of you will take it, what are we going to do with the throne?”","Jun Linyuan said, “It went back to where it came from, of course.”","Feng Wu looked perplexed.","Jun Linyuan took Feng Wu’s hand. “If I were to stay here in the imperial capital, my grandfather would make me take that job no matter what. So, would you like to travel the world with me?” Feng Wu blushed.","She knew what Jun Linyuan meant.","Jun Linyuan looked into her eyes. “Xiao Wu, would you like that?” Feng Wu lowered her head and said in a low voice, “I didn’t say no.”","Jun Linyuan was elated. “We’re leaving now!”","If they delayed, the Emperor Emeritus would definitely make him the emperor.","Therefore, Jun Linyuan marched toward the door with Feng Wu in his arms.","“Wait. Are we leaving just like that? What about the throne? And what about the Luo family? And..","“The throne will go back to where it came from.”","“What do you mean?”","“If my grandfather can do it himself, let him. He’s been free for so many years, anyway.” Jun Linyuan said indifferently, “When we have a baby, the child will take over.”","“What if we have a daughter?”","“Then she’ll be the empress.”","Feng Wu said, “What about the Luo family...”","Jun Linyuan said, “Don’t worry. Master Luo Nantian has reached an agreement with my uncle. From now on, the Luo family will be a local force, and the royal family can’t interfere...’","The news of Jun Linyuan and Feng Wu’s departure soon reached the imperial palace.","WHAT?!","The Emperor Emeritus jumped out of bed. “How could he run away?!”","The Sacred Elder One also had a resigned look on his face. He then sent a message to Emperor Emeritus. “He said that when he and Miss Feng Wu have a baby, they’ll agree to let the baby inherit the throne if you need it.”","“What about now?”","“He said that you’re a strong man...","“I’m too old to be strong! That brat... Let’s go!”","“Where are you going?” The elder stopped the Emperor Emeritus.","“If he can run, why can’t I? Which direction did they go?”","“Northwest.’","The Emperor Emeritus smacked the table. “Let’s go in that direction as well!”","“But the throne...’","“I still have a son, don’t I? Let him do his job!” The Emperor Emeritus dragged the Sacred Elder One into a carriage and left the city.","When Mu Jiuzhou heard the news, the beautiful master was speechless.","However, he had so many excellent disciples. They could do the job for him.","The end.."]}]);
